"shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/playlist\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011578"},"it":{"name":"Playlist","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/playlist\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011578"},"cn":{"name":"Playlist","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/playlist\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011578"},"fr":{"name":"Playlist","shortdescr":"\u00c7a vous rappellera votre premier amour !","longdescr":"C\u2019est l\u2019histoire d\u2019une bande (en fait, pas si) originale : Anna (Lio la vraie), Serge (Riton Liebman) et Fred (Erico Salamone) ont form\u00e9 le groupe de rock que tous les ados ont r\u00eav\u00e9 de former \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque\u2026 Vous voyez tr\u00e8s bien : le genre de band qui connait son petit succ\u00e8s sur les radios libres, o\u00f9 la chanteuse sort avec le guitariste tout en \u00e9tant amoureuse du bassiste, et qui se fantasme ins\u00e9parable. Jusqu\u2019au jour o\u00f9 la vie devient s\u00e9rieuse et qu\u2019ils se s\u00e9parent, bah oui.\n\nLes deux gar\u00e7ons ont maintenu le contact, tant bien que mal. Pas Anna. Il faudrait une guerre nucl\u00e9aire \u2013 ou pire, un concert-retrouvailles \u2013 pour qu\u2019ils la revoient\u2026\n\nCe seront les deux, mon g\u00e9n\u00e9ral ! Le temps d\u2019une (peut-\u00eatre ultime\u2026) soir\u00e9e au bord du pr\u00e9cipice, ils vont r\u00e9ussir \u00e0 vous faire rire en revisitant un par un les termes du bon vieux Sex, Drugs & Rock\u2019n\u2019Roll (R.I.P. Ian Dury\u2026), tout en priant pour une seule chose : ne pas se faire attraper par leurs enfants.\n\nNo future sans pass\u00e9. Et surtout, pas de Playlist sans musique !","performers":"De Albert Maizel Mise en sc\u00e8ne Miriam Youssef Avec Riton Liebman, Lio et Erico Salamone Assistanat \u00e0 la mise en sc\u00e8ne Pauline Haugness et Lucia Siatidis Sc\u00e9nographie Sophie Hazebrouck Costumes Laurence Van H Cr\u00e9ation lumi\u00e8re Alain Collet Son Laurent Beumier Production Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Toison d\u2019Or \u00a9 Photo Lou Verschueren","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/playlist\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011578"},"sp":{"name":"Playlist","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/playlist\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011578"},"nl":{"name":"Playlist","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/playlist\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011578"}},"place":{"id":227607,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Toison d'Or","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Toison d'Or","address_street_number":"396","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ttotheatre.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 510 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la To