one_contact":"+32 2 512 13 85","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003292"},"en":{"name":"\u00ab Outstitution Human Being \u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/blogs\/news\/expo-outstitution-human-being","email":"info@montdepiete.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 13 85","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003292"},"it":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Outstitution Human Being \u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/blogs\/news\/expo-outstitution-human-being","email":"info@montdepiete.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 13 85","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003292"},"cn":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Outstitution Human Being \u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/blogs\/news\/expo-outstitution-human-being","email":"info@montdepiete.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 13 85","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003292"},"fr":{"name":"\u00ab Outstitution Human Being \u00bb","shortdescr":"\u00c0 l'initiative de Jean-Luc Moerman, fondateur de l'asbl BicyclEat, le projet \"Outstitution Human Being\" rassemble plusieurs artistes dans une collaboration cr\u00e9ative visant \u00e0 donner visibilit\u00e9 aux personnes sans-abri et \u00e0 sensibiliser sur leur r\u00e9alit\u00e9.","longdescr":"\u00c0 l'initiative de Jean-Luc Moerman, fondateur de l'asbl BicyclEat, le projet \"Outstitution Human Being\" rassemble plusieurs artistes dans une collaboration cr\u00e9ative visant \u00e0 donner visibilit\u00e9 aux personnes sans-abri et \u00e0 sensibiliser sur leur r\u00e9alit\u00e9.\n\nLES Artistes\neva Kerremans - Jean-Luc Moerman - Jo Voets - Karl Philips - Mathias Vancoppenolle - Philippe de Kemmeter - Sylvian Patte - Vincen Beeckman et l'Art School\n\nDATES\nDu vendredi 8 au dimanche 24 novembre 2024\n\nHORAIRES de L'EXPO\nMardis (10-16h)\nVendredis (13-19h)\nSamedis et dimanches (11-16h)\n\nVERNISSAGE\nLe vendredi 8 novembre 2024 de 17h \u00e0 22h\n\nAU Programme\n. Atelier les mardis sur les th\u00e8mes de la peinture de l\u2019artiste et de l'entraide aux plus d\u00e9munis (dur\u00e9e : 1h20) : Les \u00e9l\u00e8ves observeront et interpr\u00e9teront les \u0153uvres. Ensuite, ils s\u2019exprimeront par un geste artistique gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la peinture, la musique, le rythme, le th\u00e9\u00e2tre et l'art th\u00e9rapie. L'activit\u00e9 est gratuite.\n\u2192 R\u00e9servation : Delphine Berryer  et Flore d'Ansembourg , )\n\nEntr\u00e9e gratuite, sans r\u00e9servation (sauf pour l'atelier).\n\nPlus d'infos sur l'expo : https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/blogs\/news\/expo-outstitution-human-being","performers":"Eva Kerremans - Jean-Luc Moerman - Jo Voets - Karl Philips - Mathias Vancoppenolle - Philippe de Kemmeter - Sylvian Patte - Vincen Beeckman et l'Art School\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/blogs\/news\/expo-outstitution-human-being","email":"info@montdepiete.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 13 85","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003292"},"sp":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Outstitution Human Being \u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/blogs\/news\/expo-outstitution-human-being","email":"info@montdepiete.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 13 85","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003292"},"nl":{"name":"\u00ab Outstitution Human Being \u00bb","shortdescr":"Op initiatief van Jean-Luc Moerman, oprichter van de vzw BicyclEat, brengt het project 'Outstitution Human Being' verschillende kunstenaars samen in een creatieve samenwerking die erop gericht is om daklozen zichtbaarheid te geven en bewustzijn te cre\u00ebren over hun realiteit.","longdescr":"Op initiatief van Jean-Luc Moerman, oprichter van de vzw BicyclEat, brengt het project 'Outstitution Human Being' verschillende kunstenaars samen in een creatieve samenwerking die erop gericht is om daklozen zichtbaarheid te geven en bewustzijn te cre\u00ebren over hun realiteit.\n\n\u2139 PRAKTISCHE INFORMATIE\n\nData van de tentoonstelling\nVan vrijdag 8 t\/m zondag 24 november 2024\n\nOpeningsuren van de tentoonstelling\n\nDinsdag 12\/11 en 19\/11: 10u - 16u\nVrijdag 15\/11 en 22\/11 : 13u - 19u\nZaterdag 9\/11, 16\/11 en 23\/11 en zondag 10\/11, 17\/11 en 24\/11 : 11u - 16u\nVernissage\nVrijdag 8 november van 17u tot 22u\n\nOp het programma:\n\n. Workshop over het thema van de schilderkunst van de kunstenaar en het helpen van kansarmen (duur: 1u20): De leerlingen observeren en interpreteren de werken. Daarna zullen ze zich artistiek uitdrukken door middel van schilderen, muziek, ritme, theater en kunstzinnige therapie. De activiteit is gratis.\n\u2192 Reservering: Delphine Berryer 0478 21 52 62 en Flore d\u2019Ansembourg 0486 19 08 87, artschool.asbl@gmail.com)\n\nGratis toegang, zonder reservering (behalve de workshop)\n\nMeer info over de tentoonstelling: https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/nl\/blogs\/news\/expo-outstitution-human-being","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/nl\/blogs\/news\/expo-outstitution-human-being","email":"info@bergvanbarmhartigheid.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 13 85","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003292"}},"place":{"id":221323,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mont de Pi\u00e9t\u00e9 (Caisse Publique de Pr\u00eats)","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Ghislain","address_street_number":"1923","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":"+32 