+32 470 37 38 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003608"},"pt":{"name":"Flash Christmas Markets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/flashcapsules.com\/","email":"contact@flashcapsules.com","phone_contact":"0666406408","phone_booking":"+32 470 37 38 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003608"},"en":{"name":"Flash Christmas Markets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/flashcapsules.com\/","email":"contact@flashcapsules.com","phone_contact":"0666406408","phone_booking":"+32 470 37 38 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003608"},"it":{"name":"Flash Christmas Markets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/flashcapsules.com\/","email":"contact@flashcapsules.com","phone_contact":"0666406408","phone_booking":"+32 470 37 38 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003608"},"cn":{"name":"Flash Christmas Markets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/flashcapsules.com\/","email":"contact@flashcapsules.com","phone_contact":"0666406408","phone_booking":"+32 470 37 38 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003608"},"fr":{"name":"Flash Christmas Markets","shortdescr":"Du 22 novembre au 22 d\u00e9cembre, Flash Capsules organise des micro pop-ups festifs et color\u00e9s ! Pour l'occasion, la team donne les cl\u00e9s de son espace caf\u00e9 \u00e0 de cr\u00e9ateur.ice.s in\u00e9dit.e.s et les invite \u00e0 exposer leurs cr\u00e9ations le temps d'un week-end. ","longdescr":"Pour les f\u00eates de fin d\u2019ann\u00e9e, le concept-store et coffee shop Flash Capsules (qui f\u00eate sa premi\u00e8re ann\u00e9e \u00e0 Bruxelles mi-novembre), met en place des micro march\u00e9s de cr\u00e9ateur.ice.s. C\u2019est au sein de son espace caf\u00e9 que na\u00eetront des installations regroupant 3 \u00e0 4 designers chaque vendredi et samedi entre le 22 novembre et le 22 d\u00e9cembre.\nCes pop-ups seront l\u2019occasion de mettre en lumi\u00e8re et faire d\u00e9couvrir des designers in\u00e9dit.e.s, au milieu des 70 d\u00e9j\u00e0 pr\u00e9sent\u00e9.e.s dans la boutique, toujours dans la m\u00eame lign\u00e9e : du design belge et fran\u00e7ais sous toutes ses formes, du fait main, du fun et de la couleur!\nOn notera la pr\u00e9sence de la cr\u00e9atrice de Retro Reset, que l\u2019on ne pr\u00e9sente plus \u00e0 Bruxelles, pour les trois premi\u00e8res \u00e9ditions.\nSoutenir l\u2019artisanat local et trouver des id\u00e9es de cadeaux uniques autour d\u2019animations cr\u00e9atives, illuminations et food r\u00e9confortante, (hot-dogs, soupes maison, cookies).\n\nPour d\u00e9couvrir le programme complet: https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/3849419245385637\/3849419248718970\/\n\nFlash Capsules est n\u00e9 en 2020, d\u2019une passion commune pour le design et d\u2019une amiti\u00e9\nde plus de 25 ans. Apr\u00e8s une premi\u00e8re aventure d\u2019un an \u00e0 Paris, Fanny et Juliette emm\u00e8nent leur projet jusque Bruxelles, dans un espace cosy et insolite au c\u0153ur de la ville rue des Chartreux, situ\u00e9 entre les boutiques Isabelle Bajart et Encr\u00e9.\nPr\u00e9sentant d\u00e9sormais plus de 70 cr\u00e9ateur.ice.s belges et fran\u00e7ais, ce projet hybride a pour vocation de mettre en avant les cr\u00e9ations d\u2019artistes travaillant principalement \u00e0 la main et \u00e0 partir de mat\u00e9riaux durables et\/ou recycl\u00e9s, avec une direction artistique haute en couleurs.\nEspace caf\u00e9, shop en ligne, expositions, concerts, lancements de collection : tout est bon pour rythmer le projet au maximum et soutenir cet artisanat vivant dans un cadre friendly, o\u00f9 on se sent un peu comme \u00e0 la maison.\n\nToutes les actualit\u00e9s ici : https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/flashcapsules\/ et ici : https:\/\/flashcapsules.com\/","performers":"Retro Reset (fashion); Studio Unwo (illustration); Nerina (illustration); Th\u00e9o Clayette (graphic design) ; Neerual (illustration); Trama (illustration); Juliette Farges (illustration); Berlioz on the moon (ceramic); Oriane Thomasson (photography); Wol Cha (fashion); Pauline \u00c9tienne (fashion); Candide Candide (jewelry); Lorette Knit (fashion); Cl\u00e9oph\u00e9e (fashion); Rinvest (fashion); Studio Virgule ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/flashcapsules.com\/","email":"contact@flashcapsules.com","phone_contact":"0666406408","phone_booking":"+32 470 37 38 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003608"},"sp":{"name":"Flash Christmas Markets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/flashcapsules.com\/","email":"contact@flashcapsules.com","phone_contact":"0666406408","phone_booking":"+32 470 37 38 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003608"},"nl":{"name":"Flash Christmas Markets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/flashcapsules.com\/","email":"contact@flashcapsules.com","phone_contact":"0666406408","phone_booking":"+32 470 37 38 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003608"}},"place":{"id":50001670,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Flash Capsule","address_street_name":"Rue des Chartreux","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/flashcapsules.com\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Chartreux, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,