r\n\r\nDiscover famous illusions such as the mirror room or the vortex but also experiences never seen before in Belgium. Get ready for a visit full of surprises and emotions!\r\n\r\nThroughout your visit, meet the well-known neurologist, author and Francqui Prize winner Steven Laureys in the Science Corners. Learn about the five senses, the way our brain works, and discover what happens when we interact with illusions and how we treat the information sent by our environment.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"D\u00e9fiez votre cerveau avec le WOM !\r\n\r\nSitu\u00e9 \u00e0 Tour & Taxis dans un espace de plus de 1 500m\u00b2, le WOM \u201cWorld of Mind\u201d vous invite pour une exp\u00e9rience rythm\u00e9e, pleine de surprises et riche en \u00e9motions dans un parcours immersif sur les perceptions et les illusions.\r\n\r\nPlus de 80 illusions visuelles, tactiles et auditives vous attendent, de quoi questionner la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 dans un univers interactif \u00e0 l\u2019esth\u00e9tique color\u00e9e.\r\n\r\nRetrouvez le neurologue Steven Laureys dans les corners de science tout au long du parcours, pour en apprendre plus sur les cinq sens et le fonctionnement de notre cerveau de mani\u00e8re ludique et surprenante !\r\n","description_print":"D\u00e9fiez votre cerveau avec le WOM !\r\nSitu\u00e9 \u00e0 Tour & Taxis dans un espace de plus de 1 500m\u00b2, le WOM \u201cWorld of Mind\u201d vous invite pour une exp\u00e9rience rythm\u00e9e, pleine de surprises et riche en \u00e9motions dans un parcours immersif sur les perceptions et les illusions. \t\r\nPlus de 60 illusions visuelles, tactiles et auditives vous attendent, de quoi questionner la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 dans un univers interactif \u00e0 l\u2019esth\u00e9tique color\u00e9e.\r\nRetrouvez le neurologue Steven Laureys dans les corners de science tout au long du parcours, pour en apprendre plus sur les cinq sens et le fonctionnement de notre cerveau de mani\u00e8re ludique et surprenante !\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","