ntact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Europakruispunt","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":[],"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":42939,"location":{"lat":50.8459599,"lon":4.3561696},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-08-20T11:28:07+02:00","published_at":"2024-08-20T11:28:07+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":50000434,"translations":{"de":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Gaucheretstraat","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Gaucheretstraat, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"With the guides from 91eme parall\u00e8le, you can take a step back in time, discover uncharted territory and embark on a journey to the heart of history, legends, architecture and music... always with the quirky point of view that is their trademark. Why 91st parallel? Horizontally, each of the Earth's hemispheres is divided into imaginary circles linking places on the same latitude. The equator is point 0, and the North and South Poles are the 90th parallels.\n\nSo there is no 91st parallel... A team name is a bit zany, a real nod to Belgian surrealism!\n\nPublic and private tours, for young and old. All our 'trips' are listed in the online diary on our website.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Avec les guides de 91eme parall\u00e8le, prenez de la hauteur, d\u00e9couvrez des territoires inconnus, embarquez dans des voyages au c\u0153ur de l\u2019Histoire, des l\u00e9gendes, de l\u2019architecture, de la musique... toujours avec ce petit point de vue d\u00e9cal\u00e9 qui fait leur marque de fabrique. Pourquoi 91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le ? Horizontalement, chaque h\u00e9misph\u00e8re terrestre est divis\u00e9 en cercles imaginaires reliant les lieux se trouvant sur une m\u00eame latitude. L\u2019\u00e9quateur est le point 0, les P\u00f4le nord et sud sont les 90eme parall\u00e8les.\nIl n'y a donc pas de 91eme parall\u00e8le...Un nom d'\u00e9quipe est un peu loufoque, un v\u00e9ritable petit clin d\u2019\u0153il au surr\u00e9alisme belge !\n\n\nVisites publiques et priv\u00e9es, pour petits et grands, jeunes et moins jeunes. Tous nos \"voyages\" sont repris dans l'agenda en ligne sur notre site internet.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Gaucheretstraat","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Gaucheretstraat, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"Met de gidsen van 91e parall\u00e8le kun je een stap terug in de tijd zetten, onbekend terrein ontdekken en op reis gaan naar het hart van de geschiedenis, legendes, architectuur en muziek... altijd met de eigenzinnige invalshoek die hun handelsmerk is. Waarom de 91e breedtegraad? Horizontaal is elk halfrond van de aarde verdeeld in denkbeeldige cirkels die plaatsen op dezelfde breedtegraad met elkaar verbinden. De evenaar is punt 0 en de noord- en zuidpool zijn de 90e breedtegraad.\n\nEr is dus geen 91e breedtegraad... Een teamnaam is een beetje zany, een echte knipoog naar het Belgische surrealisme!\n\nOpenbare en priv\u00e9reizen, voor jong en oud. Al onze reizen staan vermeld in de online agenda op onze website.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":41178,"location":{"lat":50.8624095,"lon":4.3601281},"last_updated_at":"2024-06-17T12:57:33+02:00","published_at":"2023-08-28T11:27:17+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/31bc6939cccbc2f8c2357ae883aa4a7d888464ad.jpg","width":2000,"height":1318,"ratio":1.52,"oEmbed_height":1318,"oEmbed_width":2000,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Quartiers populaires, art nouveau populaire ?","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Quartiers populaires, art nouveau populaire ?","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Quartiers populaires, art nouveau populaire ?","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Quartiers populaires, art nouveau populaire ?","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Quartiers populaires, art nouveau populaire ?","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"Quartiers populaires, art nouveau populaire ?","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Quartiers populaires, art nouveau populaire ?","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Quartiers populaires, art nouveau populaire ?","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2024-11-23","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"12:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Normal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"}},"value":15},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Kinder"},"en":{"name":"Children"},"it":{"name":"Bambini"},"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"sp":{"name":"Ni\u00f1os"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"}},"value":13}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["exterior","annee_art_nouveau"]},{"id":5700002649,"date_start":"2024-11-23","date_end":"2024-11-24","date_next":"2024-11-23","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-11-07T18:52:01+01:00","published_at":"2024-10-16T12:12:24+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":309827,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"foire","ranking":1,"languages":{"spoken":["en","nl","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":70,"translations":{"de":"Messe & Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Fairs and shows","it":"Fiere ed esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Foire & salon","sp":"Feria y exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Beurzen & salons"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Grrrabuge Future Wine Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/","email":"salongrabuge@gmail.com","phone_contact":"0","phone_booking":"0","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002649"},"pt":{"name":"Grrrabuge Future Wine Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/","email":"salongrabuge@gmail.com","phone_contact":"0","phone_booking":"0","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002649"},"en":{"name":"Grrrabuge Future Wine Festival","shortdescr":"Natural wine tasting & sales\n\nGrrrabuge brings together producers from all over Europe, selected for the quality of their wines and their commitment to viticulture that is profoundly respectful of the environment: militant wines from committed people!\nFor 2 days, it will be possible to taste and buy their wines at special prices.","longdescr":"GRRRABUGE 2024 - 2\u1d49 edition\n\nThe GRRRABUGE festival of natural wines and fermented beverages is back for another edition with even more winemakers!\n\n- Where and when? - \nIn a place of creation and collective emulation: LaVall\u00e9e Bruxelles, Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e 39, 1080 Brussels\nSaturday, November 23 and Sunday, November 24, 2024\n\n- Program -\nNatural wine tasting & sales\nGrrrabuge brings together producers of natural wines from all over Europe, selected for the quality of their wines and their commitment to viticulture that is profoundly respectful of the environment: militant wines from committed people!\n\nOver the 2 days of the festival, wine and gastronomy professionals and enthusiasts will be able to meet some 50 winemakers, taste their wines and buy their bottles directly at special prices.\n\nHere are just some of the winemakers you'll be able to meet:\n\u2022\tNatural wine pioneers: like Rudolf Trossen (Moselle, Germany) or Angiolino Maule (Veneto, Italy).\n\u2022\tNew winemakers who've been established for less than 5 years: such as Caroline Led\u00e9dent\u00e9 (Bugey), Henri Chauvet (Auvergne), Matthias Orsett (Switzerland), L\u00e9na and Alexis des Bois Perdus (Ard\u00e8che) and many others.\n\u2022\tDefenders of hybrid and resistant grape varieties: Les Pieds dans la Dyle (Belgium), Dassemus (Netherlands), Nadia Beaune (Loire), Lilian Bauchet (Beaujolais), Karine and Cyril Alonso (Beaujolais)...\n\u2022\tOthers practicing agroforestry: Les Funambules (Alsace), Muller-Koeberl\u00e9 (Alsace), Quinta da Olival da Murta (Portugal), Ch\u00e2teau Lestignac (Bergerac)...\n\nConferences and round tables\n\u2022\tJulie Reux, journalist and founder of the Vinofutur media, will host two round tables on topics such as sexism in wine, water management and climate change. She will also be inviting Sandrine Goeyvaerts, journalist and sommelier known for her feminist commitment.\n\u2022\tDominique Hutin, journalist at France Inter, will host a conference entitled \u201c24 centilitres per second\u201d, retracing 120 years of wine history through 24 film extracts.\n\u2022\tRudolf Trossen, pioneer of biodynamic viticulture, will present a masterclass on the subject.\n\u2022\tFurther workshops and round tables will be announced shortly.\n\nCollab' with the Magma label for the Saturday evening party\nWe've teamed up with Brussels-based label Magma to bring you a groovy line-up to match!\n\u2022\t8pm - Matthias Orset (D\u00e9cal\u00e9 records)\n\u2022\t10pm - Borokov-Borokov (Magma Collective)\n\u2022\t11pm - Margo (Magma Collective)\n\nLet's eat!\nAll weekend long, we're calling on our favorite restaurateurs to spoil you:\n\u2022\tEl Camion\n\u2022\tRed Mullet\n\u2022\tLes hu\u00eetres de Liesse\nAnd for even more gourmet delights, we're teaming up with Le Fooding magazine to invite 2 winners of the 2024 guide. We'll be announcing their names very soon!\n\n- Opening times -\nMornings (10am-12pm) reserved for professionals\n\nSaturday, November 23, 2024\n\u2022\tWine fair and conferences: 10am - 7pm\n\u2022\tConcerts: 8pm - 2am\n\u2022\tFood area: 12pm - 10pm\n\nSunday, November 24, 2024\n\u2022\tWine fair and conferences: 10 am - 6 pm\n\u2022\tFood area: 12pm - 6pm\n\nThe full concert and conference program will soon be available on our website: https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/\n\n- Prices -\n\u2022\t2-day pass: 25\u20ac (online only)\n\u2022\tSaturday: 17\u20ac (including access to evening concerts) (on site: 20\u20ac)\n\u2022\tSunday: 12\u20ac (on-site: 15\u20ac)\n\u2022\tPro rate (per day, entry before noon): 10\u20ac.\n\nAll tickets give access to all tastings, conferences and activities at no extra charge. When you arrive, you'll receive your own complimentary Grrrabuge tasting glass.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=GRRRABUGE&s=4EDD34DE-0A94-40B6-F8DC-858018C7414E&lg=en","website":"https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/","email":"salongrabuge@gmail.com","phone_contact":"0","phone_booking":"0","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002649"},"it":{"name":"Grrrabuge Future Wine Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/","email":"salongrabuge@gmail.com","phone_contact":"0","phone_booking":"0","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002649"},"cn":{"name":"Grrrabuge Future Wine Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/","email":"salongrabuge@gmail.com","phone_contact":"0","phone_booking":"0","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002649"},"fr":{"name":"Grrrabuge Future Wine Festival","shortdescr":"D\u00e9gustation & vente de vins naturels\n\nGrrrabuge rassemble des producteur\u00b7rice\u00b7s venu\u00b7e\u00b7s de toute l'Europe, s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9\u00b7e\u00b7s pour la qualit\u00e9 de leurs vins et leur engagement pour une viticulture profond\u00e9ment respectueuse de l'environnement : des vins militants port\u00e9s par des personnes engag\u00e9es !\nDurant 2 jours, il sera possible de go\u00fbter et d'acheter leurs vins \u00e0 des prix avantageux.\n","longdescr":"GRRRABUGE 2024 - 2\u1d49 \u00e9dition\n\nLe festival de vins naturels et de boissons ferment\u00e9es GRRRABUGE est de retour pour une nouvelle \u00e9dition avec encore plus de vigneron\u00b7ne\u00b7s !\n\n- O\u00f9 et quand ? - \nDans un lieu de cr\u00e9ation et d'\u00e9mulation collective : LaVall\u00e9e Bruxelles, Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e 39, 1080 Bruxelles\nLes samedi 23 et dimanche 24 novembre 2024\n\n- Au programme -\nD\u00e9gustation & vente de vins naturels\nGrrrabuge rassemble des producteur\u00b7rice\u00b7s de vins naturels venu\u00b7e\u00b7s de toute l'Europe, s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9\u00b7e\u00b7s pour la qualit\u00e9 de leurs vins et leur engagement pour une viticulture profond\u00e9ment respectueuse de l'environnement : des vins militants port\u00e9s par des personnes engag\u00e9es !\n\nDurant les 2 jours du festival, les professionnel\u00b7le\u00b7s et les amateur\u00b7rice\u00b7s de vins et de gastronomie pourront rencontrer une cinquantaine de vigneron\u00b7ne\u00b7s, go\u00fbter leurs vins et acheter directement leurs bouteilles \u00e0 des prix avantageux.\n\nVoici quelques-un\u00b7e\u00b7s des vigneron\u00b7ne\u00b7s que vous pourrez rencontrer :\n\u2022\tDes pionnier\u00b7\u00e8re\u00b7s du vin naturel : comme Rudolf Trossen (Moselle, Allemagne) ou Angiolino Maule (V\u00e9n\u00e9tie, Italie).\n\u2022\tDes n\u00e9o-vigneron\u00b7ne\u00b7s install\u00e9\u00b7e\u00b7s depuis moins de 5 ans : tels que Caroline Led\u00e9dent\u00e9 (Bugey), Henri Chauvet (Auvergne), Matthias Orsett (Suisse), L\u00e9na et Alexis des Bois Perdus (Ard\u00e8che) et tant d\u2019autres.\n\u2022\tDes d\u00e9fenseur\u00b7euse\u00b7s des c\u00e9pages hybrides et r\u00e9sistants : Les Pieds dans la Dyle (Belgique), Dassemus (Pays-Bas), Nadia Beaune (Loire), Karine et Cyril Alonso (Beaujolais)...\n\u2022\tD'autres qui pratiquent l\u2019agroforesterie : Les Funambules (Alsace), Muller-Koeberl\u00e9 (Alsace), Quinta da Olival da Murta (Portugal) ou encore le Ch\u00e2teau Lestignac (Bergerac).\n\nConf\u00e9rences et tables rondes\n\u2022\tJulie Reux, journaliste et fondatrice du m\u00e9dia Vinofutur, animera deux tables rondes sur des th\u00e8mes comme le sexisme dans le vin, la gestion de l'eau ou le changement climatique. Elle invitera notamment Sandrine Goeyvaerts, journaliste, sommeli\u00e8re connue pour son engagement f\u00e9ministe.\n\u2022\tDominique Hutin, journaliste \u00e0 France Inter, animera la conf\u00e9rence \"24 centilitres par seconde\", retra\u00e7ant 120 ans d\u2019histoire du vin \u00e0 travers 24 extraits de films.\n\u2022\tRudolf Trossen, pionnier de la biodynamie, pr\u00e9sentera une masterclass sur le sujet.\n\u2022\tD'autres ateliers et tables rondes seront annonc\u00e9s prochainement.\n\nCollaboration sp\u00e9ciale avec le label Magma pour la soir\u00e9e du samedi soir\nNous sommes ravis de nous allier avec le label bruxellois Magma pour vous proposer un line-up groovy \u00e0 souhait ! \n\u2022\t20h - Matthias Orset (D\u00e9cal\u00e9 Records) \n\u2022\t22h - Borokov-Borokov (Magma Collective)\n\u2022\t23h - Margo (Magma Collective)\n\n\u00c0 table !\nPendant tout le week-end, nos restaurateurs pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s vous r\u00e9galeront.\n\u2022\tEl Camion\n\u2022\tRed Mullet\n\u2022\tLes hu\u00eetres de Liesse. \nPour encore plus de gourmandise, nous nous associons avec le magazine Le Fooding pour inviter deux laur\u00e9ats du guide 2024. Leurs noms seront annonc\u00e9s tr\u00e8s bient\u00f4t.\n\n- Horaires -\nLes matin\u00e9es de 10h \u00e0 12h sont r\u00e9serv\u00e9es aux professionnels.\n\nSamedi 23 novembre 2024\n\u2022\tSalon et conf\u00e9rences : 10h - 19h\n\u2022\tEspace food : 12h - 22h\n\u2022\tConcerts : 20h - 2h  \n\nDimanche 24 novembre 2024\n\u2022\tSalon et conf\u00e9rences : 10h - 18h\n\u2022\tEspace food : 12h - 18h\n\nLe programme complet des concerts et des conf\u00e9rences sera disponible tr\u00e8s bient\u00f4t sur notre site internet : salongrrrabuge.be.\n\n- Tarifs -\n\u2022\tPass 2 jours : 25\u20ac (uniquement en ligne)\n\u2022\tSamedi : 17\u20ac (acc\u00e8s aux concerts inclus), sur place : 20\u20ac \n\u2022\tDimanche : 12\u20ac, sur place : 15\u20ac. \n\u2022\tTarif pro : 10\u20ac par jour, entr\u00e9e obligatoire avant midi.\n\nTous les billets donnent acc\u00e8s \u00e0 toutes les d\u00e9gustations, conf\u00e9rences et activit\u00e9s sans frais suppl\u00e9mentaires. En arrivant, vous recevrez votre propre verre de d\u00e9gustation Grrrabuge offert.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=GRRRABUGE&s=4EDD34DE-0A94-40B6-F8DC-858018C7414E&lg=fr","website":"https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/","email":"salongrabuge@gmail.com","phone_contact":"0","phone_booking":"0","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002649"},"sp":{"name":"Grrrabuge Future Wine Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/","email":"salongrabuge@gmail.com","phone_contact":"0","phone_booking":"0","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002649"},"nl":{"name":"Grrrabuge Future Wine Festival","shortdescr":"Natuurlijke wijnproeverijen & verkoop\n\nGrrrabuge brengt producenten uit heel Europa samen, geselecteerd voor de kwaliteit van hun wijnen en hun inzet voor een wijnbouw die het milieu diep respecteert: strijdbare wijnen van ge\u00ebngageerde mensen!\nGedurende 2 dagen is het mogelijk om hun wijnen te proeven en te kopen tegen speciale prijzen.","longdescr":"GRRRABUGE 2024 - 2\u1d49 editie\n\nHet GRRRABUGE-festival van natuurlijke wijnen en gefermenteerde dranken is terug voor een nieuwe editie met nog meer wijnmakers!\n\n- Waar en wanneer? -\nOp een plek van creatie en collectieve emulatie: LaVall\u00e9e Bruxelles, Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e 39, 1080 Brussel\nZaterdag 23 november en zondag 24 november 2024\n\n- Programma -\nNatuurlijke wijnproeverij & verkoop\nGrrrabuge brengt producenten van natuurlijke wijnen uit heel Europa samen, geselecteerd op de kwaliteit van hun wijnen en hun toewijding aan een wijnbouw die het milieu diep respecteert: militante wijnen van ge\u00ebngageerde mensen!\n\nGedurende de 2 dagen van het festival kunnen wijn- en gastronomieprofessionals en -liefhebbers zo'n 50 wijnmakers ontmoeten, hun wijnen proeven en hun flessen rechtstreeks kopen tegen speciale prijzen.\n\nDit zijn slechts enkele van de wijnmakers die u kunt ontmoeten:\n\u2022\tPioniers van natuurlijke wijn: zoals Rudolf Trossen (Moezel, Duitsland) of Angiolino Maule (Veneto, Itali\u00eb).\n\u2022\tNieuwe wijnmakers die minder dan 5 jaar actief zijn: zoals Caroline Led\u00e9dent\u00e9 (Bugey), Henri Chauvet (Auvergne), Matthias Orsett (Zwitserland), L\u00e9na en Alexis des Bois Perdus (Ard\u00e8che) en vele anderen.\n\u2022\tVerdedigers van hybride en resistente druivensoorten: Les Pieds dans la Dyle (Belgi\u00eb), Dassemus (Nederland), Nadia Beaune (Loire), Karine en Cyril Alonso (Beaujolais)...\n\u2022\tAnderen die agroforestry beoefenen: Les Funambules (Elzas), Muller-Koeberl\u00e9 (Elzas), Quinta da Olival da Murta (Portugal), Ch\u00e2teau Lestignac (Bergerac)...\n\nConferenties en rondetafelgesprekken\n\u2022\tJulie Reux, journaliste en oprichter van de Vinofutur media, zal twee rondetafelgesprekken organiseren over onderwerpen als seksisme in wijn, waterbeheer en klimaatverandering. Ze zal ook Sandrine Goeyvaerts uitnodigen, journaliste en sommeliere die bekendstaat om haar feministische inzet.\n\u2022\tDominique Hutin, journaliste bij France Inter, zal een conferentie organiseren met de titel \"24 centiliter per seconde\", waarin 120 jaar wijngeschiedenis wordt herbelicht aan de hand van 24 filmfragmenten.\n\u2022\tRudolf Trossen, pionier van de biodynamische wijnbouw, zal een masterclass over dit onderwerp geven.\n\u2022\tBinnenkort worden er meer workshops en rondetafelgesprekken aangekondigd.\n\nSamenwerking met het label Magma voor het feest op zaterdagavond\nWe zijn een samenwerking aangegaan met het Brusselse label Magma om je een groovy line-up te bieden die daarbij past!\n\u2022\t20.00 uur - Matthias Orset (D\u00e9cal\u00e9 records)\n\u2022\t22.00 uur - Borokov-Borokov (Magma Collective)\n\u2022\t23.00 uur - Margo (Magma Collective)\n\nLaten we eten!\nHet hele weekend lang roepen we onze favoriete restauranthouders op om je te verwennen:\n\u2022\tEl Camion\n\u2022\tRed Mullet\n\u2022\tLes hu\u00eetres de Liesse\nEn voor nog meer gastronomische hoogstandjes werken we samen met het tijdschrift Le Fooding om 2 winnaars van de gids van 2024 uit te nodigen. We maken hun namen binnenkort bekend!\n\n- Openingstijden -\nOchtenden (10.00-12.00 uur) voorbehouden voor professionals\n\nZaterdag 23 november 2024\n\u2022\tBeurs en congressen: 10.00-19.00 uur\n\u2022\tEetruimte: 12.00-22.00 uur\n\u2022\tConcerten: 20.00-02.00 uur\n\nZondag 24 november 2024\n\u2022\tBeurs en congressen: 10.00-18.00 uur\n\u2022\tEetruimte: 12.00-18.00 uur\n\nHet volledige concert- en congresprogramma is binnenkort beschikbaar op onze website: https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/\n\n- Prijzen -\n\u2022\t2-dagenpas: 25\u20ac (alleen online)\n\u2022\tZaterdag: 17\u20ac (inclusief toegang tot avondconcerten) (ter plaatse: 20\u20ac)\n\u2022\tZondag: 12\u20ac (ter plaatse: 15\u20ac)\n\u2022\tPro rata (per dag, toegang voor 12.00 uur): 10\u20ac.\n\nAlle tickets geven toegang tot alle proeverijen, conferenties en activiteiten zonder extra kosten. Bij aankomst ontvangt u uw eigen gratis Grrrabuge-proefglas.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=GRRRABUGE&s=4EDD34DE-0A94-40B6-F8DC-858018C7414E&lg=nl","website":"https:\/\/www.salongrrrabuge.be\/","email":"salongrabuge@gmail.com","phone_contact":"0","phone_booking":"0","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002649"}},"place":{"id":273242,"translations":{"de":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e, 39","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e, 39","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e Straat","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e Straat, 39","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"LaVall\u00e9e, a 6 000 m\u00b2 former industrial laundry in Molenbeek, is a 'third place' that houses a community of artists and creative entrepreneurs, offering a multidisciplinary cultural programme, as well as spaces for rent. \r\n\r\nIt is a dynamic and friendly space thanks to the synergies between its various occupants, and its high quality yet offbeat programming.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e, 39","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e, 39","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e, 39","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Ancienne blanchisserie industrielle de 6 000 m\u00b2 \u00e0 Molenbeek, LaVall\u00e9e est un tiers-lieu abritant une communaut\u00e9 d\u2019artistes et d\u2019entrepreneurs cr\u00e9atifs, proposant une programmation culturelle pluridisciplinaire, ainsi que des espaces \u00e0 la location. \r\n\r\nUn espace dynamique et convivial gr\u00e2ce a