:57:30+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":204134,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Understanding Brussels to better defend it!\r\nARAU was founded in 1969, in a context of \u2018Brusselsisation\u2019 and the exodus of Brussels residents to the periphery. The challenge at the time, which is still relevant today, was to defend and promote the inhabited city and a quality of life for all the inhabitants of Brussels. This led to major protests against demolition projects on the one hand and the development of counter-projects on the other, with a view to urban renewal and improving the living environment.\r\nThe ARAU intends, through its action to raise awareness and inform the population, to provide the public with the necessary tools to monitor the evolution of the city. This action takes the form of the publication of analyses and studies, the organisation of conferences and workshops, press releases, etc., as well as guided tours.\r\nThese tours, which are pioneering in the Brussels region and have been organised since 1977, aim to enhance the city and its assets, and to develop a critical view of its transformations, which includes the preservation and maintenance of its heritage.\r\nOver the years, the ARAU has developed a rich catalogue of guided tours on various themes: \u201cUnmissable Brussels\u201d, \u201cArchitecture\u201d, \u201cBrussels in Districts\u201d, \u201cThe City in Transformation\u201d, \u201cSummer Journey\u201d, \u201cA Brussels House\u201d, \u201cBrussels: City of Trams\u201d, \u201cSocial Brussels\u201d, which can be discovered during public tours or in the form of private, customised tours.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"ARAU - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Comprendre Bruxelles pour mieux la d\u00e9fendre !\r\nL\u2019ARAU a \u00e9t\u00e9 fond\u00e9 en 1969, dans un contexte de \u00ab bruxellisation \u00bb et d\u2019exode des Bruxellois vers la p\u00e9riph\u00e9rie. L\u2019enjeu \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque, toujours d\u2019actualit\u00e9 : d\u00e9fendre et promouvoir la ville habit\u00e9e et une qualit\u00e9 de vie pour tous les Bruxellois, ce qui s\u2019est traduit par d\u2019importantes contestations de projets de d\u00e9molition d\u2019une part et le d\u00e9veloppement de contre-projets d\u2019autre part, dans une optique de r\u00e9novation urbaine et d\u2019am\u00e9lioration du cadre de vie.\r\nL\u2019ARAU entend, par son action de sensibilisation et d\u2019information de la population, mettre \u00e0 disposition du public les outils n\u00e9cessaires pour suivre l\u2019\u00e9volution de la ville. Cette action se mat\u00e9rialise \u00e0 travers la publication d\u2019analyses et d\u2019\u00e9tudes, l\u2019organisation de colloques et d\u2019ateliers, des communiqu\u00e9s de presse, \u2026ainsi que de visites guid\u00e9es.\r\nCes visites, pionni\u00e8res en r\u00e9gion bruxelloise et organis\u00e9es depuis 1977, visent \u00e0 revaloriser la ville et ses atouts, \u00e0 d\u00e9velopper un regard critique sur ses transformations, ce qui passe par la sauvegarde et l\u2019entretien de son patrimoine.\r\nAu fil de toutes ces ann\u00e9es, l\u2019ARAU a d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 un riche catalogue de visites guid\u00e9es se d\u00e9clinant en diverses th\u00e9matiques : \u00ab Bruxelles incontournable \u00bb, \u00ab Architecture \u00bb, \u00ab Bruxelles en quartiers \u00bb, \u00ab La ville en transformation \u00bb, \u00ab Parcours d\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 \u00bb, \u00ab Une maison bruxelloise \u00bb, \u00ab Bruxelles : ville de trams \u00bb, \u00ab Bruxelles sociale \u00bb, qu\u2019il est possible de d\u00e9couvrir lors de tours publics ou sous forme de visites priv\u00e9es, personnalisables.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Zuidstraat","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zuidstraat, 165","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Brussel begrijpen om het beter te kunnen verdedigen!\r\nHet ARAU werd opgericht in 1969, in een context van \u201cBrusselisering\u201d en de uittocht van de Brusselaars naar de rand. De uitdaging van die tijd, die ook vandaag nog actueel is, bestond erin de bewoonde stad en de levenskwaliteit van alle Brusselaars te verdedigen en te bevorderen. Dat leidde tot grote protesten tegen afbraakprojecten enerzijds en de ontwikkeling van tegenprojecten anderzijds, met het oog op stadsvernieuwing en verbetering van de leefomgeving.\r\nHet ARAU wil met zijn bewustmakings- en voorlichtingsactie de bevolking de nodige instrumenten aanreiken om de evolutie van de stad te volgen. Deze actie neemt de vorm aan van de publicatie van analyses en studies, de organisatie van conferenties en workshops, perscommuniqu\u00e9s, enz. en rondleidingen.\r\nDeze rondleidingen, die baanbrekend zijn in het Brusselse Gewest en al sinds 1977 worden georganiseerd, hebben tot doel de stad en haar troeven tot hun recht te laten komen en een kritische kijk te ontwikkelen op haar transformaties, die ook het behoud en de instandhouding van haar erfgoed inhouden.\r\nIn de loop der jaren heeft het ARAU een rijke catalogus van rondleidingen over verschillende thema\u2019s samengesteld: \u201cOnmisbaar Brussel\u201d, \u201cArchitectuur\u201d, \u201cBrussel in wijken\u201d, \u201cDe stad in transformatie\u201d, \u201cZomerreis\u201d, \u201cEen Brussels huis\u201d, \u201cBrussel: stad van de trams\u201d, \u201cSociaal Brussel\u201d, die tijdens openbare rondleidingen of in de vorm van priv\u00e9rondleidingen op maat kunnen worden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":422,"location":{"lat":50.84343195,"lon":4.34634563},"last_updated_at":"2024-10-29T08:58:17+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:31+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/d0de60be8a85d213d1c287877867b8a25b541715.jpg","width":1416,"height":2128,"ratio":0.67,"oEmbed_height":2128,"oEmbed_width":1416,"translations":{"de":{"title":"L'Art nouveau pour tous","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"L'Art nouveau pour tous","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"L'Art nouveau pour tous","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"L'Art nouveau pour tous","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"L'Art nouveau pour tous","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"L'Art nouveau pour tous","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"L'Art nouveau pour tous","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"L'Art nouveau pour tous","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2024-11-24","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"12:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Normal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"}},"value":13},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Jugendliche"},"en":{"name":"Youth"},"it":{"name":"Ragazzi"},"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"sp":{"name":"J\u00f3venes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"}},"value":9},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Seniors"},"it":{"name":"Anziani"},"fr":{"name":"Seniors"},"sp":{"name":"Mayores"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"}},"value":9},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Article 27"},"pt":{"name":"Article 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"},"it":{"name":"Article 27"},"cn":{"name":"Article 27"},"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"sp":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"}},"value":1.25}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["annee_art_nouveau"]},{"id":5700002437,"date_start":"2024-11-24","date_end":"2024-11-24","date_next":"2024-11-24","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-11-14T09:37:10+01:00","published_at":"2024-10-10T11:49:47+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":309521,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"concert","ranking":1,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"de":"Konzert","pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: PERPETUUM","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002437"},"pt":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: PERPETUUM","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002437"},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: Anthony Romaniuk & Traffik Klassik","shortdescr":"The Coudenberg Palace presents the fourth edition of Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, an eclectic festival where music meets history. Artists from Brussels and beyond will enchant their audience in this unique archaeological site in the heart of Europe. ","longdescr":"The Coudenberg Palace presents the fourth edition of Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, an eclectic festival where music meets history. Artists from Brussels and beyond will enchant their audience in this unique archaeological site in the heart of Europe. \n\nThe four double concerts take place every Sunday evening from 24\/11 until 15\/12 2024 and will celebrate consort music in all its forms and instrumental combinations, from string and keyboard ensembles to saxophone and recorder quartets. \n\nSun 24 Nov 18.30 \nPERPETUUM \u2013 The eternal quest for authentic sound\nAnthony Romaniuk (AU) + Traffik Klassik (BE) \nMusic by J. S. Bach, H. Purcell, E. Satie, improvisations et al.\n\nAnthony Romaniuk, virginal, harpsichord & electro-acoustic keyboard\nTraffik Klassik, (Dirk Vandaele, Baroque violin, Manuela Bucher, Baroque viola, Michel Boulanger, Baroque cello)\n\nSurrounded by an array of keyboards, Anthony Romaniuk seamlessly blends a repertoire spanning centuries, creating an uninterrupted flow of music. Through this perpetual motion, familiar compositions are revealed in a fresh, innovative light. He will perform in Coudenberg for the first time several pieces from his recent albums Perpetuum (Alpha, Outhere Music) offering a truly unique experience in sound.\n\nFounded in 2015 by cellist Michel Boulanger, Traffik Klassik performs for the first time at Coudenberg Palace, presenting a selection from J.S. Bach's famous Goldberg Variations: Goldberg in pocket form. The string trio arrangement performs on historical instruments and sheds new light on the work, giving both the beloved Aria and the variations a more vocal and human quality.\n\nThis concert is 1 of 4 - each on Sunday evenings from 18:30. They will take place on 24\/11, 1\/12, 8\/12 and 15\/12. More info on: https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002437"},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: PERPETUUM","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002437"},"cn":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: PERPETUUM","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002437"},"fr":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: Anthony Romaniuk & Traffik Klassik","shortdescr":"Le Palais du Coudenberg pr\u00e9sente la quatri\u00e8me \u00e9dition du Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, un festival \u00e9clectique o\u00f9 la musique rencontre l'histoire. Des artistes de Bruxelles et d'ailleurs enchanteront leur public dans ce site arch\u00e9ologique unique au c\u0153ur de l'Europe. ","longdescr":"Le Palais du Coudenberg pr\u00e9sente la quatri\u00e8me \u00e9dition du Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, un festival \u00e9clectique o\u00f9 la musique rencontre l'histoire. Des artistes de Bruxelles et d'ailleurs enchanteront leur public dans ce site arch\u00e9ologique unique au c\u0153ur de l'Europe. \n\nLes quatre concerts doubles ont lieu tous les dimanches soirs du 24\/11 au 15\/12 2024 et c\u00e9l\u00e9breront la musique de consort sous toutes ses formes et combinaisons instrumentales, des ensembles \u00e0 cordes et claviers aux quatuors de saxophones et de fl\u00fbtes \u00e0 bec.\n\nDim 24 nov 18h30\nPERPETUUM \u2013 La qu\u00eate \u00e9ternelle du son authentique\nAnthony Romaniuk (AU) + Traffik Klassik (BE)\nMusique de J. S. Bach, H. Purcell, E. Satie, improvisations, etc.\n\nAnthony Romaniuk, virginal, clavecin & clavier \u00e9lectroacoustique\nTraffik Klassik (Dirk Vandaele, violon baroque; Manuela Bucher, alto baroque; Michel Boulanger, violoncelle baroque)\n\nEntour\u00e9 d'une s\u00e9rie de claviers, Anthony Romaniuk m\u00eale sans effort un r\u00e9pertoire qui traverse les si\u00e8cles, cr\u00e9ant un flux de musique ininterrompu. \u00c0 travers ce mouvement perp\u00e9tuel, des compositions famili\u00e8res sont r\u00e9v\u00e9l\u00e9es sous une lumi\u00e8re nouvelle et innovante. Il interpr\u00e9tera \u00e0 Coudenberg pour la premi\u00e8re fois plusieurs morceaux de ses albums r\u00e9cents \"Perpetuum\" (Alpha Outhere Music), offrant une exp\u00e9rience sonore vraiment unique.\n\nFond\u00e9 en 2015 par le violoncelliste Michel Boulanger, Traffik Klassik se produira pour la premi\u00e8re fois au Palais de Coudenberg en pr\u00e9sentant une s\u00e9lection des c\u00e9l\u00e8bres Variations Goldberg de J.S. Bach : Goldberg en format de poche. L'arrangement pour trio \u00e0 cordes sur instruments historiques donne \u00e0 la fois \u00e0 l'Aria et aux variations une qualit\u00e9 plus vocale et humaine.\n\nCe concert est le premier d'une s\u00e9rie de 4 - chacun des dimanches soirs \u00e0 partir de 18h30. Ils auront lieu les 24\/11, 1\/12, 8\/12 et 15\/12. Plus d'informations : https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002437"},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: PERPETUUM","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002437"},"nl":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: Anthony Romaniuk & Traffik Klassik","shortdescr":"Het Coudenbergpaleis presenteert de vierde editie van Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, een eclectisch festival waar muziek en geschiedenis elkaar ontmoeten. Artiesten uit Brussel en daarbuiten zullen hun publiek betoveren in deze unieke archeologische site in het hart van Europa. ","longdescr":"Het Coudenbergpaleis presenteert de vierde editie van Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, een eclectisch festival waar muziek en geschiedenis elkaar ontmoeten. Artiesten uit Brussel en daarbuiten zullen hun publiek betoveren in deze unieke archeologische site in het hart van Europa. \n\nDe vier dubbelconcerten, elke zondagavond van 24\/11 tot en met 15\/12, vieren consortmuziek in al zijn vormen en instrumentale combinaties, van ensembles van strijk- en toetsinstrumenten tot saxofoon- en blokfluitkwartetten. \n\nZo 24 nov 18.30\nPERPETUUM \u2013 De eeuwige zoektocht naar authentiek geluid\nAnthony Romaniuk (AU) + Traffik Klassik (BE)\nMuziek van J. S. Bach, H. Purcell, E. Satie, improvisaties, enz.\n\nAnthony Romaniuk, virginal, klavecimbel & elektro-akoestisch keyboard\nTraffik Klassik (Dirk Vandaele, barokviool; Manuela Bucher, barokaltviool; Michel Boulanger, barokcello)\n\nOmringd door een reeks keyboards, mixt Anthony Romaniuk moeiteloos een repertoire dat eeuwen omspant en cre\u00ebert zo een ononderbroken stroom van muziek. Door deze eeuwige beweging worden bekende composities onthuld in een nieuw en innovatief licht. Hij zal voor het eerst verschillende stukken uit zijn recente albums \"Perpetuum\" (Alpha Outhere Music) uitvoeren in Coudenberg, wat een unieke ervaring in geluid biedt.\n\nOpgericht in 2015 door cellist Michel Boulanger, zal Traffik Klassik voor het eerst optreden in het Coudenbergpaleis met een selectie uit de beroemde Goldbergvariaties van J.S. Bach: Goldberg in zakformaat. Het arrangement voor strijktrio op historische instrumenten geeft zowel de geliefde Aria als de variaties een meer vocale en menselijke kwaliteit.\n\nDit concert is er 1 van 4 - telkens op zondagavond vanaf 18:30. Ze vinden plaats op 24\/11, 1\/12, 8\/12 en 15\/12. Meer info op: https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002437"}},"place":{"id":50002549,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Koningsplein","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Koningsplein, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Koningsplein","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Koningsplein, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":[],"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":43293,"location":{"lat":50.8428945,"lon":4.3597604},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-10-18T11:27:00+02:00","published_at":"2024-10-18T11:27:00+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":258195,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein unterirdischer Parcours, in dessen Verlauf Sie die \u00dcberreste des Palastes von Charles V. entdecken k\u00f6nnen. Seit dem Mittelalter \u00fcberragt eine f\u00fcrstliche Residenz auf dem Coudenberg die Stadt Br\u00fcssel. Das architektonische Ensemble, das sich seit dem 12. Jahrhundert immer wieder weiterentwickelt hat, gilt als einer der sch\u00f6nsten Pal\u00e4ste Europas und eine der wichtigsten Residenzen von Karl V. Dieses prestigetr\u00e4chtige Geb\u00e4ude wurde bei einem Brand im Februar 1731 schwer besch\u00e4digt. Vierzig Jahre sp\u00e4ter wurden die Ruinen des Palasts dem Erdboden gleichgemacht, um Platz f\u00fcr den Place Royale zu machen. Die \u00dcberreste dieses Geb\u00e4udes bilden heute die arch\u00e4ologische St\u00e4tte des Coudenberg. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire.  Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n \r\nWhen you visit it you can explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground.  In the Coudenberg Museum, located in Hoogstraeten House, the finest of the archeological discoveries made during the various excavations of the Coudenberg site are displayed.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Palazzo","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\"Il sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\tSito Archeologico di Coudenbergl sito...\"\r\n\r\nIl sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nSito Archeologico di Coudenberg\r\n\r\nl sito riunisce vestigia dell'antico palazzo di Bruxelles, della residenza di Hoogstraeten e della Rue Isabelle. Un'affascinante passeggiata che vi conduce sotto il pav\u00e9 della place Royale, alla scoperta dei resti del Palazzo di Coudenberg che fu una delle residenze principali di Carlo V. \u00a0\r\n\r\nMuseo del Coudenberg\r\nil museo vi invita a scoprire un'esposizione permanente di oggetti trovati durante gli scavi effettuati sul sito negli ultimi 25 anni. potete combinare la vostra visita con quella del Museo BELvue.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n \r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. Dans le mus\u00e9e du Coudenberg, qui est abrit\u00e9 dans l\u2019h\u00f4tel d\u2019Hoogstraeten, sont expos\u00e9es les plus belles d\u00e9couvertes arch\u00e9ologiques effectu\u00e9es lors des diff\u00e9rentes campagnes de fouilles men\u00e9es sur le site du Coudenberg\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palacio","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"En el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas....\r\n\r\nEn el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg est\u00e1 compuesto de vestigios del antiguo Palacio de Bruselas, del Hotel Hoogstraeten y de la Rue Isabelle.\u00a0Este fascinante paseo te llevar\u00e1 a descubrir los vestigios del Palacio Coudenberg, que fue una de las residencias de Carlos V.\r\n\r\nMuseo Coudenberg\r\n\r\nInstalado en los vestigios del antiguo Hotel de Hoogstraeten, el Museo Coudenberg  te invita a descubrir una exposici\u00f3n permanente de objetos hallados durante las distintas excavaciones arqueol\u00f3gicas realizadas los \u00faltimos 25 a\u00f1os.\u00a0Podr\u00e1s combinar tu visita del Coudenberg con la del Museo BELvue.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. Vele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\n \r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt! In het museum van de Coudenberg, dat in het bovengrondse Hof van Hoogstraeten ondergebracht is, kan je de mooiste archeologische voorwerpen bewonderen die in de loop van de verschillende opgravingswerken op de Coudenbergsite werden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":18195,"location":{"lat":50.8426107,"lon":4.3606882},"last_updated_at":"2024-06-14T16:22:27+02:00","published_at":"2014-05-05T10:58:29+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/526c01f0fafedae43f4df23e68b7eb13af8d4b78.png","width":