children's version, so everyone can enjoy the experience. Good to know: free walking tours are available on the TOOTbus app. \n\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=TOOTBUS&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=AF1AE33F-70EC-B13E-FB4B-CB1CA5286F4E&lg=EN","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"TOOTbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Vous avez la flemme de marcher, ou de planifier vos trajets pour optimiser votre s\u00e9jour \u00e0 Bruxelles ? TOOTbus vous propose de vous asseoir, de vous d\u00e9tendre \u2026 et de s\u2019occuper du reste. \u00c0 travers deux trajets, ce bus \u00e9lectrique sillonne les rues de la capitale, glissant entre b\u00e2tisses historiques et nouvelles constructions design, symboles de la ville et quartiers populaires ; \u00e9grainant, au fil des arr\u00eats, les must see de la capitale. Les deux lignes proposent, tout au long des parcours, un total de 16 arr\u00eats, o\u00f9 vous pouvez monter et descendre comme bon vous semble. A bord, les explications audios sont disponibles dans de nombreuses langues, et connaissent m\u00eame une version kids pour ne d\u00e9laisser personne. Bon \u00e0 savoir : des tours \u00e0 pied gratuits sont propos\u00e9s dans l\u2019app TOOTbus!","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=TOOTBUS&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=AF1AE33F-70EC-B13E-FB4B-CB1CA5286F4E&lg=FR","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Keizerinlaan","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Keizerinlaan, 54","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ben je het wandelen beu, of heb je geen zin om je bezoek aan Brussel uit te stippelen? TOOTbus doet het werk voor je ! Stap op, ga lekker zitten en geniet van het uitzicht. Deze elektrische bus rijdt dwars door de hoofdstad, langs historische gebouwen, nieuwe ontwerpen, stadssymbolen en populaire wijken. Elke halte valt er wel een hoogtepuntje van de hoofdstad te bespeuren. De twee lijnen bieden in totaal 26 haltes langs de route, waar je kunt in- en uitstappen wanneer je maar wilt. Aan boord is de audiouitleg in vele talen beschikbaar en er is zelfs een kinderversie. Een rondleiding op maat van iedereen! Goed om te weten: er staan gratis wandelroutes voorgesteld in de applicatie van TOOTbus. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=TOOTBUS&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=AF1AE33F-70EC-B13E-FB4B-CB1CA5286F4E&lg=NL","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":39843,"location":{"lat":50.8472979,"lon":4.3569056},"last_updated_at":"2024-06-06T12:03:25+02:00","published_at":"2023-01-20T13:46:20+01:00","is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/fe2677b36034163063ad59f1b768c7f5ed2177d9.JPG","width":6240,"height":4160,"ratio":1.5,"oEmbed_height":4160,"oEmbed_width":6240,"translations":{"de":{"title":"TOOTBUS Christmas Tour","copyright":"\u00a9Tootbus"},"pt":{"title":"TOOTBUS Christmas Tour","copyright":"\u00a9Tootbus"},"en":{"title":"TOOTBUS Christmas Tour","copyright":"\u00a9Tootbus"},"it":{"title":"TOOTBUS Christmas Tour","copyright":"\u00a9Tootbus"},"cn":{"title":"TOOTBUS Christmas Tour","copyright":"\u00a9Tootbus"},"fr":{"title":"TOOTBUS Christmas Tour","copyright":"\u00a9Tootbus"},"sp":{"title":"TOOTBUS Christmas Tour","copyright":"\u00a9Tootbus"},"nl":{"title":"TOOTBUS Christmas Tour","copyright":"\u00a9Tootbus"}}},{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/fc59333ba5327dcd434d41b5a58db223f960e18b.png","width":983,"height":654,"ratio":1.5,"oEmbed_height":654,"oEmbed_