ebsite":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","email":"info@cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000797"},"fr":{"name":"Cabaret lyrique \u201cIn french please\u201d","shortdescr":"Cassons les codes et les corps ! Laissons les conventions au placard et d\u00e9couvrons l\u2019univers d\u00e9cal\u00e9 des cabarets berlinois des ann\u00e9es 30\u2026 mais en fran\u00e7ais ! Dans cette revue grin\u00e7ante, No\u00e9mie et Justine vous interpr\u00e8tent principalement Kurt Weill mais aussi Mistinguett, Poulenc, Offenbach et d\u2019autres\u2026 Elles vous content l\u2019amour, les r\u00eaves, le vertige en alternant musique et d\u00e9clamation. ","longdescr":"Cassons les codes et les corps ! Laissons les conventions au placard et d\u00e9couvrons l\u2019univers d\u00e9cal\u00e9 des cabarets berlinois des ann\u00e9es 30\u2026 mais en fran\u00e7ais ! Dans cette revue grin\u00e7ante, No\u00e9mie et Justine vous interpr\u00e8tent principalement Kurt Weill mais aussi Mistinguett, Poulenc, Offenbach et d\u2019autres\u2026 Elles vous content l\u2019amour, les r\u00eaves, le vertige en alternant musique et d\u00e9clamation. Le temps d\u2019une soir\u00e9e, elles ressuscitent cette ambiance d\u00e9cal\u00e9e et d\u00e9cadente o\u00f9 la libert\u00e9 est le ma\u00eetre mot. Elles abordent des textes tant\u00f4t l\u00e9gers tant\u00f4t graves sans jamais sombrer dans la complaisance. Dans ce spectacle, on ne cherche pas \u00e0 ordonner le chaos, on s\u2019y baigne et s\u2019y abandonne\n\nPartie 1\n\n    Alabama song, tir\u00e9e de Grandeur et d\u00e9cadence de la ville de Mahagonny, Kurt Weill;\n    Nous voulons une petite soeur, Francis Poulenc;\n    Je cherche un millionnaire, Mistinguett;\n    Jenny des Corsaires, issu de l'Op\u00e9ra de quat'sous, Kurt Weill;\n    I'm a stranger here myself, Kurt Weill;\n    Habanera de Carmen, George Bizet;\n    Tor\u00e9ador, Francis Poulenc ;\n    Chanson de Barbara, tir\u00e9e de l'op\u00e9ra de quat'sous, Kurt Weill\n\nPartie 2\n\n    \u2022Air de la griserie, issu de la P\u00e9richole, Jacques Offenbach;\n    On me nomme H\u00e9l\u00e8ne la Blonde, issu de la Belle H\u00e9l\u00e8ne, Jacques Offenbach ;\n    J'ai deux amants, Andr\u00e9 Messager;\n    Barcarolle : Belle nuit, tir\u00e9e des Contes d'Hoffman, Jacques Offenbach;\n    Mein Herr, tir\u00e9 de la com\u00e9die musicale Cabaret;\n    Je ne t'aime pas, Kurt Weill;\n    Youkali, Kurt Weill","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","email":"info@cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000797"},"sp":{"name":"Cabaret lyrique \u201cIn french please\u201d","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","email":"info@cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000797"},"nl":{"name":"Cabaret lyrique \u201cIn french please\u201d","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","email":"info@cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000797"}},"place":{"id":233318,"translations":{"de":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Waterloose Steenweg","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Waterloose Steenweg, 717 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":" \u2018C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village\u2019, the landmark caf\u00e9 and theatre in Uccle is celebrating its 20th birthday\r\nTwenty years of \u2018evenings among friends\u2019, dedicated to helping local artists meet their audience (allowing them to wander freely through the art) and dedicated to welcoming artists of great calibre, with improbable duos such as Nilda Fernandez and Adamo or Arielle Dombasle and Philippe Katerine. Dedicated, too, to artists who have passed on, such as Georges Moustaki, Michel Delpech and Maurane.\r\nIt also aims to train the artists of tomorrow with the l\u2019\u00c9cole de Th\u00e9\u00e2tre M\u00e9thode Actors Studio\u00a9.\u2019","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village est le caf\u00e9-th\u00e9\u00e2tre par excellence d'Uccle depuis plus de 20 ans et peut maintenant se targuer d'une liste impressionnante d'invit\u00e9s. Un certain Adamo, Philip Catherine et Maurane ont donn\u00e9 le meilleur d'eux-m\u00eames ici. Souvenirs dor\u00e9s pour ceux qui \u00e9taient l\u00e0 \u00e0 l'\u00e9poque, en petit comit\u00e9. Mais C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village, c'est bien plus que cela. C'est l\u00e0 que naissent les artistes et humoristes de demain, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des stages et des formations intensives selon la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre m\u00e9thode de l\u2019Actors Studio\u00a9.  Ce lieu charismatique dot\u00e9 d\u2019une mission vous charmera \u00e0 coup s\u00fbr.        \r\n\r\n \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Waterloose Steenweg","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Ukkel","address_line1":"Waterloose Steenweg, 717 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Ukkel","description_web":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village is al meer dan 20 jaar lang h\u00e9t Ukkelse theatercaf\u00e9 bij uitstek en kan ondertussen uitpakken met een indrukwekkende lijst aan gastoptredens. Grote sterren uit de Franse cultuur zoals Adamo, Philip Catherine en Maurane gaven hier ooit het beste van zichzelf. Gouden herinneringen voor wie er toen bij was, en petit comit\u00e9. C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village is echter meer dan dat. Hier worden de artiesten en humoristen van morgen geboren dankzij intensieve stages en opleidingen volgens de befaamde Actors Studio\u00a9-methode. Deze charismatische plek met een missie zal je zeker bekoren.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"cotevillage\u202f\u202f","backoffice_id":1239,"location":{"lat":50.8153832,"lon":4.3670137},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-11-18T16:58:42+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:10+02:00","import_origin":nu