rt":"2024-11-30","date_end":"2024-11-30","date_next":"2024-11-30","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-11-21T16:22:02+01:00","published_at":"2024-11-21T16:10:20+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":312299,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"concert","ranking":1.2599210498948732,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"de":"Konzert","pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[6,4],"translations":{"de":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, Rock, Jazz..."],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"it":["Worldmusic, Folk e Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"sp":["Worldmusic, folk y country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"nl":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Ljubojna, Song of North Macedonia and the Balkans","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003870"},"pt":{"name":"Ljubojna, Song of North Macedonia and the Balkans","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003870"},"en":{"name":"Ljubojna, Song of North Macedonia and the Balkans","shortdescr":"First concert in Brussels for this wonderful group from SKOPJE MACEDONIE! \nComposer and bassist Oliver Josifovski and singer Vera Josifovska Miloshevska, the heart and soul of the group, the album showcases Josifovski's compositional prowess and arranging talent, which make this fusion of Macedonian musical culture with other sounds and cultures possible. ","longdescr":"Miloshevska has a unique voice, both powerful and delicate. Highly emotional, she sings with verve and passion. Her voice is at the heart of the record, but she leaves plenty of space for the band to shine.\nFor Macedonian world music group Ljubojna, creating innovative music is a way of life. Over the past fifteen years, the group has deliberately broken boundaries and conventions in its entertaining song structures. In doing so, Luboyna has successfully navigated the musical opposites of composition and improvisation, both in the studio and live, and has expanded what is generally known as Balkan music. Although its heart and soul are deeply and firmly rooted in Macedonia and its musical traditions, the band's musical worldview has always been manifestly eclectic. Mac music is the foundation, and Luboyna manages to incorporate a wide range of different musical styles. Influences from pop, jazz, improvisation, electronica and soul abound, all underpinned by boundless enthusiasm, addictive melodies and catchy hooks. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003870"},"it":{"name":"Ljubojna, Song of North Macedonia and the Balkans","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003870"},"cn":{"name":"Ljubojna, Song of North Macedonia and the Balkans","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003870"},"fr":{"name":"Ljubojna, Song of North Macedonia and the Balkans","shortdescr":"Premier concert \u00e0 Bruxelles de ce merveilleux groupe de SKOPJE MACEDONIE ! \nLe compositeur et bassiste Oliver Josifovski et la chanteuse Vera Josifovska Miloshevska, le c\u0153ur et l'\u00e2me du groupe, l'album met en valeur les prouesses de composition et le talent d'arrangeur de Josifovski qui rendent possible cette fusion de la culture musicale mac\u00e9donienne avec d'autres sons et d'autres cultures. ","longdescr":"Miloshevska poss\u00e8de une voix unique, \u00e0 la fois puissante et d\u00e9licate. Tr\u00e8s \u00e9motive, elle chante avec verve et passion. Sa voix est au c\u0153ur du disque, mais elle laisse beaucoup d'espace au groupe pour briller.\nPour le groupe mac\u00e9donien de musique du monde Ljubojna, la cr\u00e9ation d'une musique novatrice est un mode de vie. Au cours des quinze derni\u00e8res ann\u00e9es, le groupe a d\u00e9lib\u00e9r\u00e9ment bris\u00e9 les fronti\u00e8res et les conventions dans ses structures de chansons divertissantes. Ce faisant, Luboyna a r\u00e9ussi \u00e0 naviguer entre les oppositions musicales de la composition et de l'improvisation, tant en studio qu'en concert, et a \u00e9largi ce que l'on appelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement la musique balkanique. Bien que son c\u0153ur et son \u00e2me soient profond\u00e9ment et fermement enracin\u00e9s dans la Mac\u00e9doine et ses traditions musicales, la vision du monde musical du groupe a toujours \u00e9t\u00e9 manifestement \u00e9clectique. La musique Mac est la base et Luboyna r\u00e9ussit \u00e0 y int\u00e9grer un grand nombre de musiques diff\u00e9rentes. Les influences de la pop, du jazz, de l'improvisation, de l'\u00e9lectronique et de la soul abondent, le tout soutenu par un enthousiasme sans bornes, des m\u00e9lodies addictives et des accroches. \n","performers":"Oliver Josifovski, bassist  and singer Vera Josifovska Miloshevska","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003870"},"sp":{"name":"Ljubojna, Song of North Macedonia and the Balkans","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003870"},"nl":{"name":"Ljubojna, Song of North Macedonia and the Balkans","shortdescr":"Eerste concert in Brussel voor deze geweldige groep uit SKOPJE MACEDONIE! \nComponist en bassist Oliver Josifovski en zangeres Vera Josifovska Miloshevska vormen het hart en de ziel van de groep. Het album toont Josifovski's compositorische bekwaamheid en arrangeertalent, die deze fusie van de Macedonische muziekcultuur met andere klanken en culturen mogelijk maken. ","longdescr":"Miloshevska heeft een unieke stem, zowel krachtig als delicaat. Ze is zeer emotioneel en zingt met verve en passie. Haar stem vormt het hart van de plaat, maar ze laat genoeg ruimte over voor de band om te schitteren.\nVoor de Macedonische wereldmuziekgroep Ljubojna is het cre\u00ebren van vernieuwende muziek een manier van leven. De afgelopen vijftien jaar heeft de groep bewust grenzen en conventies doorbroken in haar onderhoudende songstructuren. Door dit te doen, heeft Ljubojna met succes de muzikale tegenpolen van compositie en improvisatie bewandeld, zowel in de studio als live, en heeft ze wat algemeen bekend staat als Balkanmuziek uitgebreid. Hoewel het hart en de ziel diep en stevig geworteld zijn in Macedoni\u00eb en zijn muzikale tradities, is het muzikale wereldbeeld van de band altijd duidelijk eclectisch geweest. Mac-muziek is de basis, en Luboyna slaagt erin om een breed scala aan verschillende muziekstijlen te integreren. Invloeden uit pop, jazz, improvisatie, elektronica en soul zijn er in overvloed, allemaal ondersteund door grenzeloos enthousiasme, verslavende melodie\u00ebn en pakkende hooks. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003870"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name"