l":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003685"},"cn":{"name":"Cosmopolitan Rooftop Party [100% indoor] - Where the best of Brussels citizen meets. friday 22.11","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1204841793962067\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003685"},"fr":{"name":"Cosmopolitan Rooftop Party [100% indoor] - Where the best of Brussels citizen meets. friday 22.11","shortdescr":"\nCOSMOPOLITAN is the place to be, where the best of Brussels' international crowd comes together.\n\nBRUSSELS ROOFTOP PARTY at COCO BRUSSELS\nThis Friday, 22.11 | International Party by Just A Night\nTHIS EVENT IS 100 INDOOR - No need to worry about the weather","longdescr":"COSMOPOLITAN ROOFTOP PARTY 100 INDOOR - WHERE THE BEST OF BRUSSELS CITIZEN MEETS. FRIDAY 22.11\nhttps:\/\/fb.me\/e\/6Sa5PlcVa\n\nParty People, Get Ready!\n\nCOSMOPOLITAN is the place to be, where the best of Brussels' international crowd comes together.\n\nBRUSSELS ROOFTOP PARTY at COCO BRUSSELS\nThis Friday, 22.11 | International Party by Just A Night\nTHIS EVENT IS 100 INDOOR - No need to worry about the weather\n\nGaranty Pass & Skip the line :\nhttps:\/\/www.eventbrite.be\/e\/cosmopolitan-rooftop-party-100-indoor-where-the-best-citizen-meets-tickets-1085215561959?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\nFB : https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/6Sa5PlcVa\n\nCOSMOPOLITAN is the ultimate spot for Brussels' party people, where quality meets pleasure.\n\nGet ready to discover the best hidden chic venues in town!\n\nAs the heart of Europe, Brussels deserves a party that brings together the global community and offers a premium nightlife experience.\n\nCOSMOPOLITAN is the perfect mix of cosmopolitan guests, delicious drinks, amazing music by Triciaa, a cozy ambiance, and a luxurious venue.\n\nInvite your best friends for an unforgettable night full of fun, laughter, and quality vibes!\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT?\n\nAmazing music by Tristan H\nSignature cocktails & delicious drinks\nDancing & good vibes\nFinger food & aperitivo\nBreathtaking views of the city\nChillaxing area to relax and vibe\n\nIn partnership with Just A Night & Euro Village Labels\nAnd much more.\n\nMUSIC BY TRISTAN H: Deep \/ Chill \/ Soulful House \/ Nu Disco Funk \/ Open Format & the Best Hits\n\nExclusive Indoor Rooftop Party\nFriday 22 NOVEMBER 2024\n\nIt\u2019s our pleasure to welcome you back to Coco Brussels, one of the most exclusive and stunning venues in the city. With an amazing indoor rooftop and a winter veranda terrace, you\u2019ll have breathtaking views of Brussels' uptown treasures. Coco Brussels is a unique rooftop experience unlike any other!\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT?\nThe hottest rooftop party in Brussels.\nExpect the best DJs, the most stylish crowd, loud music, good vibes, spectacular views, and the tastiest drinks.\n\nNo need to worry about the weather.\nOur party is indoors, and the terrace is 100 covered, so you can enjoy the outdoor feel while staying warm and cozy inside. The perfect winter setting!\n\nA Party You Simply Can\u2019t Miss.\n\nCome for the party | Stay for the vibes | Bring your friends | Dress to impress | Arrive early | Spread the word\n\nDoors Open: 10:00 PM\nLine-up: Tristan H\nDress Code: Urban Chic\nEntrance Fee: At the door\n\nBelgiumRooftopParty BruxellesByNight Soir\u00e9eExclusivit\u00e9 VueImprenable\n\nJoin us for an epic night, bring your best vibes, and let\u2019s make memories!\n\nCOSMOPOLITAN is powered by Just A Night vs Euro Village\nCOCO BRUSSELS : Rue Capitaine Crespel 1 - 1050 Bruxelles\n\n","performers":"Cosmopolitan","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1204841793962067\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-d