"tags":[],"opening":{"day":"2024-10-15","end":"19:45:00","start":"18:00:00","timestamp":"2024-10-15T18:00:00"}},{"id":5700003367,"date_start":"2024-11-08","date_end":"2024-12-06","date_next":"2024-11-22","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-11-22T01:00:58+01:00","published_at":"2024-11-06T10:09:33+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":311071,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"misc","ranking":0.41008825631569273,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":84,"translations":{"de":"Verschiedenes","pt":null,"en":"Various","it":"Varie","cn":null,"fr":"Divers","sp":"Varios","nl":"Varia"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Nuage de Points","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archives.bruxelles.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003367"},"pt":{"name":"Nuage de Points","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archives.bruxelles.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003367"},"en":{"name":"Nuage de Points","shortdescr":"By wandering around this maze and getting lost in its corridors, the two artists dive into the immensity of archives. Plans, maps, administrative files, correspondence, posters, photographs and conservation boxes offer 1,000 faces, 1,000 perspectives. With each foray, you realise that nothing remains the same from one day to the next, or even from one hour to the next.","longdescr":"Have you ever visited the Archives of the City of Brussels? With Nuage de Points, sculptor Ida Wilot Maus and architect Tomas Barbera Ramallo take you on an exploratory journey through this extraordinary, labyrinthine place.\nBy wandering around this maze and getting lost in its corridors, the two artists dive into the immensity of archives. Plans, maps, administrative files, correspondence, posters, photographs and conservation boxes offer 1,000 faces, 1,000 perspectives. With each foray, you realise that nothing remains the same from one day to the next, or even from one hour to the next.\nUsing techniques from their fields\u2014architecture and sculpture, as well as photography, drawings, and writing\u2014Ida Wilot Maus and Tomas Barbera Ramallo recount their wanderings and not entirely lost hours in this heterotopic space. Working in the disciplines that reflect their different backgrounds - architecture and sculpture, as well as photography, drawing and writing - Ida Wilot Maus and Tomas Barbera Ramallo recount their wanderings and not entirely lost hours in this heterotopic space. A plunge into the archive becomes an intoxicating interpretative reading path that eschews linear progress. It\u2019s like a pop-up book that symbolizes the archives.\nWith its scenographic quality, the installation Nuage de Points conveys the distillation of what the artists have unearthed from the archives. A shelf, an a priori familiar object contains a point which represents the plastic dimension of something ephemeral, of a mirage, a cloud.\n\n","performers":"Have you ever visited the Archives of the City of Brussels? With Nuage de Points, sculptor Ida Wilot Maus and architect Tomas Barbera Ramallo take you on an exploratory journey through this extraordinary, labyrinthine place.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archives.bruxelles.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003367"},"it":{"name":"Nuage de Points","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archives.bruxelles.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003367"},"cn":{"name":"Nuage de Points","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archives.bruxelles.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003367"},"fr":{"name":"Nuage de Points","shortdescr":"En circulant dans ce d\u00e9dale, en s\u2019\u00e9garant au milieu des all\u00e9es, les deux artistes plongent dans l\u2019immensit\u00e9 du ph\u00e9nom\u00e8ne : archives. Plans, cartes, dossiers administratifs, correspondances, afiches, photographies ou bo\u00eetes de conservation offrent 1000 visages, 1000 perceptions. Chaque incursion am\u00e8ne le constat que rien n\u2019est pareil d\u2019un jour \u00e0 l\u2019autre, d\u2019une heure \u00e0 l\u2019autre. ","longdescr":"Avez-vous d\u00e9j\u00e0 pouss\u00e9 la porte des Archives de la Ville de Bruxelles ?  A Travers Nuage de Points, Ida Wilot Maus, sculpteur et Tomas Barbera Ramallo, architecte vous emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de ce lieu labyrinthique exceptionnel. \nEn circulant dans ce d\u00e9dale, en s\u2019\u00e9garant au milieu des all\u00e9es, les deux artistes plongent dans l\u2019immensit\u00e9 du ph\u00e9nom\u00e8ne : archives. Plans, cartes, dossiers administratifs, correspondances, afiches, photographies ou bo\u00eetes de conservation offrent 1000 visages, 1000 perceptions. Chaque incursion am\u00e8ne le constat que rien n\u2019est pareil d\u2019un jour \u00e0 l\u2019autre, d\u2019une heure \u00e0 l\u2019autre. \nUsant des gestes issus de leurs pratiques : l\u2019architecture et la sculpture mais aussi de la photographie, du dessin et de l\u2019\u00e9criture, Ida Wilot Maus et Tomas Barbera Ramallo racontent leurs \u00e9garements et les heures pas tout \u00e0 fait perdues \u00e0 vivre dans l\u2019h\u00e9t\u00e9rotopie. L\u2019incursion devient une folle lecture rompant avec un parcours lin\u00e9aire. Un peu comme un livre acord\u00e9on. Ce livre \u00e9tant le site m\u00eame des archives.  \nDans sa dimension sc\u00e9nographique, l\u2019installation Nuage de Points transmet le distillat des artistes immerg\u00e9s au sein des archives. Une \u00e9tag\u00e8re, un objet a priori reconnaissable, accueille un point qui, \u00e0 lui seul, rend la dimension plastique d\u2019une \u00e9vanescence, d \u2019un mirage, d \u2018un nuage. \n\n","performers":"Avez-vous d\u00e9j\u00e0 pouss\u00e9 la porte des Archives de la Ville de Bruxelles ?  A Travers Nuage de Points, Ida Wilot Maus, sculpteur et Tomas Barbera Ramallo, architecte vous emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de ce lieu labyrinthique exceptionnel. ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archives.bruxelles.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003367"},"sp":{"name":"Nuage de Points","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archives.bruxelles.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003367"},"nl":{"name":"Puntenwolk","shortdescr":"Terwijl ze door dit doolhof dwalen en soms verdwalen in de gangen, duiken de twee kunstenaars in de onmetelijkheid van de archieven. Plannen, kaarten, administratieve dossiers, correspondentie, affiches, foto\u2019s en bewaardozen: 1000 gezichten, 1000 perspectieven. Elke tocht onthult dat niets hetzelfde blijft, van dag tot dag, van uur tot uur.\n","longdescr":"Ben je ooit al in het Archief van de Stad Brussel geweest? Via Puntenwolk nemen beeldhouwster Ida Wilot Maus en architect Tomas Barbera Ramallo je mee op ontdekkingstocht door dit bijzondere, labyrintische gebouw.\nTerwijl ze door dit doolhof dwalen en soms verdwalen in de gangen, duiken de twee kunstenaars in de onmetelijkheid van de archieven. Plannen, kaarten, administratieve dossiers, correspondentie, affiches, foto\u2019s en bewaardozen: 1000 gezichten, 1000 perspectieven. Elke tocht onthult dat niets hetzelfde blijft, van dag tot dag, van uur tot uur.\nMet technieken uit hun vakgebied \u2013 architectuur en beeldhouwkunst, maar ook fotografie, tekeningen en schrift \u2013 vertellen Ida Wilot Maus en Tomas Barbera Ramallo over hun omzwervingen en niet geheel verloren uren in de heterotopie. De tocht door de archieven wordt een grillig leesparcours dat breekt met het lineaire, zoals een uitklapboek dat symbool staat voor het archief.\nPuntenwolk is een scenografische installatie die het distillaat overbrengt van wat de kunstenaars uit de archieven hebben opgedolven. Een plank, een op het eerste gezicht herkenbaar object, bevat een punt dat op zichzelf de plastische dimensie van iets vergankelijks uitdrukt: een luchtspiegeling, een wolk.\n","performers":"Ben je ooit al in het Archief van de Stad Brussel geweest? Via Puntenwolk nemen beeldhouwster Ida Wilot Maus en architect Tomas Barbera Ramallo je mee op ontdekkingstocht door dit bijzondere, labyrintische gebouw.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archives.bruxelles.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003367"}},"place":{"id":210334,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Archives de la Ville de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"65","address_street_box":null,"email":"archives@brucity.be","website":"http:\/\/archives.bruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 53 20","phone_booking":nu