},"date_start":"2024-11-15","date_end":"2024-12-08","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"opening":{"day":"2024-11-15","end":"22:00:00","start":"18:00:00","timestamp":"2024-11-15T18:00:00"}},{"id":5700001770,"date_start":"2024-11-07","date_end":"2025-02-16","date_next":"2024-11-22","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-11-22T17:22:02+01:00","published_at":"2024-09-25T15:38:46+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":308448,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"other","ranking":0.3397451558437311,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[36],"translations":{"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null],"en":["Museums and art centers"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.imal.org\/en\/events\/endbeginning","email":"info@imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001770"},"pt":{"name":"Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.imal.org\/en\/events\/endbeginning","email":"info@imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001770"},"en":{"name":"Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin","shortdescr":"Challenging long-held notions of human singularity, excessive progress, and growth \u00ab Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin \u00bb redefines the notion of care as an ecological and relational structure; as a polyphonic assemblage of shared existence between human, nature and technology.","longdescr":"What comes after damaged landscapes? Where do we build our futures on? And with whom?\n\nIn her poem End and Beginning, the Polish Nobel Laureate Wis\u0142awa Szymborska, describing a barren landscape in the aftermath of war, weaves a narrative of resilience, reflection, and hope. Reflecting on the struggles for renewal, healing and collective responsibility her words carry a diachronic significance. Although referring to a specific conflict, her verses hold a frightening and unfortunate universal validity making her call for communal action, empathy, and care more relevant than even. Inspired by Szymborska's reflection on the collapse of ideologies, the relentless passage of time and history, and the irreversible decay of the past along with everything that comes with it, iMAL wonders: How would a future built on empathy and collective care look like?\n\nChallenging long-held notions of human singularity, excessive progress, and growth Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin redefines the notion of care as an ecological and relational structure; as a polyphonic assemblage of shared existence between human, nature and technology. Embarking on an exploratory journey into alternative systems of care between humans and non-human entities, this exhibition offers a place of transformative encounters fostering self-reflection and re-imagination of the infinite possibilities of our shared futures.\n\nCurated as an intricate narrative of care, the exhibition unfolds across three interconnected circles: Care for Humans, Care for Nature and Care for Technology. The exhibition presents 11 works produced within the European Media Arts Platform (EMAP) residency program and 4 recent productions by Belgium-based artists. Their encounter offers space for reflection and reconsideration of formative societal infrastructures such as labour, communal practices, energy consumption and highlights the vitality for inter-species knowledge exchange and the importance of empathy for humans and other-than-human entities through diverse lenses. By giving agency to and drawing connections between underrepresented voices and alternative perspectives\u2014be they human, artificial, natural, or imaginative\u2014the exhibition invites the public to take a step towards unexplored territories of our shared futures and reimagine resilient collective ecosystems rooted in multispecies cooperation.\n\nHere, \"everything is intelligent and worthy of our care and conscious attention.\" (James Bridle, Ways of Being)\n\nThe Poem :\nAfter every war\nsomeone has to clean up.\nThings won\u2019t\nstraighten themselves up, after all.\n\nSomeone has to push the rubble\nto the side of the road,\nso the corpse-filled wagons\ncan pass.\n\nSomeone has to get mired\nin scum and ashes,\nsofa springs,\nsplintered glass,\nand bloody rags.\n\nSomeone has to drag in a girder\nto prop up a wall.\nSomeone has to glaze a window,\nrehang a door.\n\nPhotogenic it\u2019s not,\nand takes years.\nAll the cameras have left\nfor another war.\n\nWe\u2019ll need the bridges back,\nand new railway stations.\nSleeves will go ragged\nfrom rolling them up.\n\nSomeone, broom in hand,\nstill recalls the way it was.\nSomeone else listens\nand nods with unsevered head.\nBut already there are those nearby\nstarting to mill about\nwho will find it dull.\n\nFrom out of the bushes\nsometimes someone still unearths\nrusted-out arguments\nand carries them to the garbage pile.\n\nThose who knew\nwhat was going on here\nmust make way for\nthose who know little.\nAnd less than little.\nAnd finally as little as nothing.\n\nIn the grass that has overgrown\ncauses and effects,\nsomeone must be stretched out\nblade of grass in his mouth\ngazing at the clouds.\n\nTHE END AND THE BEGINNING\n\u2014Wis\u0142awa Szymborska, translated by Joanna Trzeciak","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.imal.org\/en\/events\/endbeginning","email":"info@imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001770"},"it":{"name":"Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.imal.org\/en\/events\/endbeginning","email":"info@imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001770"},"cn":{"name":"Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.imal.org\/en\/events\/endbeginning","email":"info@imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001770"},"fr":{"name":"Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin","shortdescr":"\u00ab Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin \u00bb remet en question les concepts de singularit\u00e9 humaine, ainsi que de progr\u00e8s et de croissance \u00e0 tout prix. L'exposition propose une red\u00e9finition de la notion de \u00ab soin \u00bb en tant que structure \u00e9cologique et relationnelle ; un assemblage polyphonique d'existences partag\u00e9es entre l'homme, la nature et la technologie. ","longdescr":"Le po\u00e8me : \n\nApr\u00e8s chacune des guerres\nil faut bien nettoyer\nUn peu d\u2019ordre dans tout \u00e7a\nne se fera pas tout seul.\n\nQuelqu\u2019un doit bien \u00e9carter\nles gravats qui encombrent les routes,\nsinon, comment passeraient\nles charrettes pleines de cadavres.\n\nQuelqu\u2019un devra patauger dans\nla fange et les cendres\nles ressorts des divans\nles d\u00e9bris de verre\nles haillons sanglants.\n\nQuelqu\u2019un doit tra\u00eener la poutre\nqui calera le mur.\nQuelqu\u2019un doit remplacer\net regonder la porte.\n\nC\u2019est pas photog\u00e9nique,\net \u00e7a prend des ann\u00e9es.\nToutes les cam\u00e9ras sont d\u00e9j\u00e0\nparties voir une autre guerre.\n\nIl faut des ponts encore,\net des gares \u00e0 nouveau.\nLes manches seront en lambeaux,\ntant on les retroussera.\n\nQuelqu\u2019un, balai \u00e0 la main,\nse souvient comment c\u2019\u00e9tait.\nUn autre \u00e9coute, en hochant\nla t\u00eate, toujours \u00e0 sa place.\nMais pr\u00e8s de ces deux-l\u00e0\ntournent d\u00e9j\u00e0 quelques autres\nque ces histoires emb\u00eatent.\n\nParfois encore quelqu\u2019un\nd\u00e9terre sous un buisson\nde vieux arguments rouill\u00e9s,\nqu\u2019il jette sur le tas d\u2019ordures.\n\nCeux qui sont au courant\ndu pourquoi du comment\nc\u00e9deront bient\u00f4t la place\n\u00e0 ceux qui en savent peu.\nPuis \u00e0 ceux qui en savent prou.\nEt enfin, rien du tout.\n\nDans l\u2019herbe qui a pouss\u00e9\nsur les causes et sur les effets\nil faut entendre quelqu\u2019un qui se couche\nun \u00e9pi entre les dents\n\u00e0 regarder les nuages.\n\nFIN ET D\u00c9BUT\n\u2014Wis\u0142awa Szymborska\n\nIn De la mort sans exag\u00e9rer, \u00a9 Po\u00e9sie\/Gallimard, 2018 \u2013 Traduction du polonais par Piotr Kaminski.\nRepris in S\u0153urs #8 \u2013 Guerre, 2022","performers":"Annelie Berner ; Johanna Bruckner ; Nicolas Gourault ; Darsha Hewitt ; Dasha Ilina ; Rosa Menkman ; Vivien Roubaud ; Caroline Sinders (in collaboration with Trammell Hudson) ; Studio Above & Below\nEndi Tupja (in collaboration with Klodianna Millona) ; The (new) Constellation (T(n)C) ; Total Refusal ; Ava Zevop ; Alex Verhaest","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.imal.org\/en\/events\/endbeginning","email":"info@imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001770"},"sp":{"name":"Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.imal.org\/en\/events\/endbeginning","email":"info@imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001770"},"nl":{"name":"Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin","shortdescr":"In \u201c Fin et d\u00e9but \/ Einde en begin \u201d wordt het begrip zorg opnieuw gedefinieerd als een ecologische en relationele structuur; als een polyfone assemblage van een gedeeld bestaan tussen mens, natuur en technologie.","longdescr":"Het gedicht :\n\nHET EINDE EN HET BEGIN\nWis\u0142awa Szymborska\n\nNa elke oorlog\nmoet iemand opruimen.\nNetjes wordt het tenslotte niet vanzelf.\n\nIemand moet het puin\nnaar de kant van de weg schuiven\nzodat de met lijken gevulde wagens\ner langs kunnen.\n\nIemand moet waden\ndoor het slijk en de as,\nde veren van canap\u00e9s,\nhet versplinterd glas,\nen de bloederige vodden.\n\nIemand moet een balk aanslepen\nom die muur te stutten,\nIemand het glas in het raam zetten,\nde deur in de hengsels tillen.\n\nFotogeniek is het niet\nen het duurt jaren.\nAlle camera\u2019s zijn al vertrokken\nvoor een nieuwe oorlog.\n\nDe bruggen moeten terug\nen de stations opnieuw.\nVan het opstropen\nzullen de mouwen rafelig worden.\n\nMet een bezem in de hand\nvertelt iemand nog hoe het was.\nIemand luistert mee\nen knikt instemmend\nMaar om hen heen\nduiken al gauw lieden op\ndie het begint te vervelen.\n\nSoms zal iemand nog\nonder een struik\ndoorgeroeste commentaren opgraven\nen naar de vuilnishoop brengen.\n\nZij die wisten\nwat hier aan de hand was,\nmoeten wijken voor hen\ndie er weinig over weten.\nEn langzaam nog minder dan weinig.\nEn ten slotte zo goed als niets.\n\nIn het gras, dat oorzaak\nen gevolg overwoekert,\nligt iemand uitgestrekt\neen grassprietje in zijn mond\nstarend naar de wolken.\n\nHET EINDE EN HET BEGIN \u2013 KONIEC I POCZATEK\n\u2014Wis\u0142awa Szymborska\u2014","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.imal.org\/en\/events\/endbeginning","email":"info@imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001770"}},"place":{"id":240068,"translations":{"de":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"iMAL ist ein international anerkanntes Kunstzentrum im Br\u00fcsseler Stadtzentrum, das den digitalen Kulturen und Technologien gewidmet ist. Sein Status als Vorreiter auf diesem Gebiet seit mehr als 20 Jahren wird durch die Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen Standorts weiter gest\u00e4rkt. Das iMAL umfasst einen gro\u00dfen Ausstellungsraum, ein hochmodernes und erweitertes FabLab und eine digitale Bibliothek.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"IMAL, CENTER FOR DIGITAL CULTURES AND TECHNOLOGY","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"iMAL is an art center for digital cultures and technology, located in the center of Brussels. Our international position as pioneer in this field since 20+ years was reinforced in 2020 with the opening of our new venue, including a large exhibition space, an expanded state-of-the-art Fablab, a digital library and more.\r\nWe support artistic and creative practices using (digital) technologies as their medium. Next to providing support for artists in their experimentation-, research- and production processes, iMAL is hosting art exhibitions, conferences, performances. Furthermore we also facilitates critical reflection, research and debates around the current and future challenges of our technological society, by stimulating cross-pollinations between art and technology.\r\nWith our wide range of activities and elaborated mediation program, we aim to empower people and inspire the next generations to actively participate in today and future digital cultures. Our Fablab encourages social inclusion and innovation towards sustainable development within the local community of Molenbeek.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"IMAL, CENTER FOR DIGITAL CULTURES AND TECHNOLOGY","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"iMAL est un centre d\u2019art de\u0301die\u0301 aux cultures et technologies nume\u0301riques, situe\u0301 dans le centre de Bruxelles et reconnu internationalement. Sa position de pionnier dans le domaine depuis plus de 20 ans est renforce\u0301e par l\u2019ouverture de son nouveau lieu, qui comprend entre autres un grand espace d\u2019exposition, un FabLab de pointe et agrandi, et une bibliothe\u0300que du nume\u0301rique.\r\nL\u2019objectif d\u2019iMAL est de soutenir les pratiques artistiques et cre\u0301atives en lien avec les nouvelles technologies, en accueillant des expositions, confe\u0301rences et performances. iMAL soutient les artistes dans leur recherche, expe\u0301rimentation et production mais iMAL est e\u0301galement un centre de re\u0301flexion ou\u0300 l\u2019on investigue et de\u0301bat des enjeux pre\u0301sents et futurs de la socie\u0301te\u0301 technologique, en favorisant les croisements entre art, science et technologie.\r\nAvec ses activite\u0301s e\u0301ducatives et de me\u0301diation, iMAL vise a\u0300 e\u0301manciper tous les publics, et permettre aux futures ge\u0301ne\u0301rations de fac\u0327onner les cultures nume\u0301riques de demain. Le FabLab cre\u0301atif d\u2019iMAL encourage l\u2019inclusion sociale dans la communaute\u0301 locale de Molenbeek et du Canal, ainsi que l\u2019innovation vers un de\u0301veloppement plus durable.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"IMAL, CENTER FOR DIGITAL CULTURES AND TECHNOLOGY","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Koolmijnenkaai","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Koolmijnenkaai","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"iMAL is een kunstencentrum voor digitale cultuur en technologie, in het centrum van Brussel. Onze internationale positie als pionier in dit veld sinds 1999 werd in 2020 nog versterkt met de opening van een nieuw gebouw met een grotere expositieruimte, een uitgebreid Fablab, een digitale bibliotheek en meer.\r\nAls organisatie ondersteunen we artistieke en creatieve praktijken die (digitale) technologie als medium gebruiken. Naast het begeleiden van artiesten bij het experimenteren, onderzoeken en ontwerpen, organiseren wij ook tentoonstellingen, conferenties, performances. Verder proberen we het publieke debat en de kritische reflectie rond de huidige en toekomstige uitdagingen van onze technologische samenleving op gang te brengen en te ondersteunen door de kruisbestuiving tussen kunst, wetenschap en technologie te stimuleren.\r\nMet onze brede waaier aan activiteiten en een uitgebreid educatief programma is ons doel om iedereen met een interesse in de kunsten en technologie te inspireren om actief deel uit te maken van digitale cultuur. Ons Fablab werkt op haar beurt rond verschillende sociale en innovatieve projecten die bijdragen tot een duurzame ontwikkeling binnen de lokale gemeenschap in Molenbeek.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"IMAL, CENTER FOR DIGITAL CULTURES AND TECHNOLOGY","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[23],"translations":{"de":["Westen"],"pt":[null],"en":["West"],"it":["Ovest"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Ouest"],"sp":["Oeste"],"nl":["West"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":2724,"location":{"lat":50.85475543,"lon":4.34206481},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-09-19T16:50:32+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:15:29+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":240068,"translations":{"de":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"iMAL ist ein international anerkanntes Kunstzentrum im Br\u00fcsseler Stadtzentrum, das den digitalen Kulturen und Technologien gewidmet ist. Sein Status als Vorreiter auf diesem Gebiet seit mehr als 20 Jahren wird durch die Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen Standorts weiter gest\u00e4rkt. Das iMAL umfasst einen gro\u00dfen Ausstellungsraum, ein hochmodernes und erweitertes FabLab und eine digitale Bibliothek.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"IMAL, CENTER FOR DIGITAL CULTURES AND TECHNOLOGY","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"iMAL is an art center for digital cultures and technology, located in the center of Brussels. Our international position as pioneer in this field since 20+ years was reinforced in 2020 with the opening of our new venue, including a large exhibition space, an expanded state-of-the-art Fablab, a digital library and more.\r\nWe support artistic and creative practices using (digital) technologies as their medium. Next to providing support for artists in their experimentation-, research- and production processes, iMAL is hosting art exhibitions, conferences, performances. Furthermore we also facilitates critical reflection, research and debates around the current and future challenges of our technological society, by stimulating cross-pollinations between art and technology.\r\nWith our wide range of activities and elaborated mediation program, we aim to empower people and inspire the next generations to actively participate in today and future digital cultures. Our Fablab encourages social inclusion and innovation towards sustainable development within the local community of Molenbeek.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"IMAL, CENTER FOR DIGITAL CULTURES AND TECHNOLOGY","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"iMAL est un centre d\u2019art de\u0301die\u0301 aux cultures et technologies nume\u0301riques, situe\u0301 dans le centre de Bruxelles et reconnu internationalement. Sa position de pionnier dans le domaine depuis plus de 20 ans est renforce\u0301e par l\u2019ouverture de son nouveau lieu, qui comprend entre autres un grand espace d\u2019exposition, un FabLab de pointe et agrandi, et une bibliothe\u0300que du nume\u0301rique.\r\nL\u2019objectif d\u2019iMAL est de soutenir les pratiques artistiques et cre\u0301atives en lien avec les nouvelles technologies, en accueillant des expositions, confe\u0301rences et performances. iMAL soutient les artistes dans leur recherche, expe\u0301rimentation et production mais iMAL est e\u0301galement un centre de re\u0301flexion ou\u0300 l\u2019on investigue et de\u0301bat des enjeux pre\u0301sents et futurs de la socie\u0301te\u0301 technologique, en favorisant les croisements entre art, science et technologie.\r\nAvec ses activite\u0301s e\u0301ducatives et de me\u0301diation, iMAL vise a\u0300 e\u0301manciper tous les publics, et permettre aux futures ge\u0301ne\u0301rations de fac\u0327onner les cultures nume\u0301riques de demain. Le FabLab cre\u0301atif d\u2019iMAL encourage l\u2019inclusion sociale dans la communaute\u0301 locale de Molenbeek et du Canal, ainsi que l\u2019innovation vers un de\u0301veloppement plus durable.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"IMAL, CENTER FOR DIGITAL CULTURES AND TECHNOLOGY","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Koolmijnenkaai","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Koolmijnenkaai","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"iMAL is een kunstencentrum voor digitale cultuur en technologie, in het centrum van Brussel. Onze internationale positie als pionier in dit veld sinds 1999 werd in 2020 nog versterkt met de opening van een nieuw gebouw met een grotere expositieruimte, een uitgebreid Fablab, een digitale bibliotheek en meer.\r\nAls organisatie ondersteunen we artistieke en creatieve praktijken die (digitale) technologie als medium gebruiken. Naast het begeleiden van artiesten bij het experimenteren, onderzoeken en ontwerpen, organiseren wij ook tentoonstellingen, conferenties, performances. Verder proberen we het publieke debat en de kritische reflectie rond de huidige en toekomstige uitdagingen van onze technologische samenleving op gang te brengen en te ondersteunen door de kruisbestuiving tussen kunst, wetenschap en technologie te stimuleren.\r\nMet onze brede waaier aan activiteiten en een uitgebreid educatief programma is ons doel om iedereen met een interesse in de kunsten en technologie te inspireren om actief deel uit te maken van digitale cultuur. Ons Fablab werkt op haar beurt rond verschillende sociale en innovatieve projecten die bijdragen tot een duurzame ontwikkeling binnen de lokale gemeenschap in Molenbeek.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"IMAL, CENTER FOR DIGITAL CULTURES AND TECHNOLOGY","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":2724,"location":{"lat":50.85475543,"lon":4.34206481},"last_updated_at":"2023-09-19T16:50:32+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:15:29+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/b08630d5d347b49c5985afda4756ccdeaca1748d.jpg","width":8256,"height":5504,"ratio":1.5,"oEmbed_height":5504,"oEmbed_width":8256,"translations":{"de":{"title":"The Potato Internet, Caroline Sinders","copyright":"\u00a9 Romane Iskaria"},"pt":{"title":"The Potato Internet, Caroline Sinders","copyright":"\u00a9 Romane Iskaria"},"en":{"title":"The Potato Internet, Caroline Sinders","copyright":"\u00a9 Romane Iskaria"},"it":{"title":"The Potato Internet, Caroline Sinders","copyright":"\u00a9 Romane Iskaria"},"cn":{"title":"The Potato Internet, Caroline Sinders","copyright":"\u00a9 Romane Iskaria"},"fr":{"title":"The Potato Internet, Caroline Sinders","copyright":"\u00a9 Romane Iskaria"},"sp":{"title":"The Potato Internet, Caroline Sinders","copyright":"\u00a9 Romane Iskaria"},"nl":{"title":"The Potato Internet, Caroline Sinders","copyright":"