gestes artistiques d'envergure que le public est invit\u00e9 \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir.\n \nLa Verri\u00e8re \u00e0 Bruxelles, sous le commissariat de Jo\u00ebl Riff, est un lieu qui accueille des projets sp\u00e9cialement con\u00e7us par les artistes invit\u00e9s. La Fondation accompagne de pr\u00e8s toutes les \u00e9tapes du processus de cr\u00e9ation et soutient le d\u00e9veloppement de d\u00e9marches et de gestes artistiques originaux, depuis leur production jusqu'\u00e0 leur pr\u00e9sentation au public\".\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"VERRI\u00c8RE","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La Verri\u00e8re","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Waterloo","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"laverriere.mediation@ext.hermes.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationdentreprisehermes.org","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2-511.20.62","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Waterloo, 50","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"La Verri\u00e8re","address_street_name":"Waterloolaan","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"laverriere.mediation@ext.hermes.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationdentreprisehermes.org","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2-511.20.62","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Waterloolaan, 50","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De Verri\u00e8re-Herm\u00e8s die in 2000 werd opgericht, maakt deel uit van het internationale netwerk van galerijen van de Fondation d\u2019entreprise Herm\u00e8s. Deze Stichting steunt projecten die een echo vormen van het universum van het huis Herm\u00e8s: opwaardering voor ambachtelijke kennis en steun aan creativiteit, betrokkenheid bij onderwijs en bij het milieu. De Stichting ontwikkelt haar eigen programma's: tentoonstellingen en artiestenresidenties voor de plastische kunsten, Prix Emile Herm\u00e8s voor design, knowhow-academie, oproepen voor projecten rond biodiversiteit. In het raam van haar mecenaat produceert en promoot la Verri\u00e8re elk jaar vier expo\u2019s van hedendaagse kunst, gekoppeld aan designpresentaties. Voor elke tentoonstelling wordt een kleine catalogus gepubliceerd","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"VERRI\u00c8RE","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":1572,"location":{"lat":50.8369255,"lon":4.3564729},"last_updated_at":"2024-08-23T09:06:51+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:27+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/9454ab019bea0228c0cecd25438f1658c0222400.jpg","width":3024,"height":4032,"ratio":0.75,"oEmbed_height":4032,"oEmbed_width":3024,"translations":{"de":{"title":" La Verri\u00e8re - Visite guid\u00e9e \u00ab Spektrum \u00bb ","copyright":"Anne Marchis Mouren"},"pt":{"title":" La Verri\u00e8re - Visite guid\u00e9e \u00ab Spektrum \u00bb ","copyright":"Anne Marchis Mouren"},"en":{"title":" La Verri\u00e8re - Visite guid\u00e9e \u00ab Spektrum \u00bb ","copyright":"Anne Marchis Mouren"},"it":{"title":" La Verri\u00e8re - Visite guid\u00e9e \u00ab Spektrum \u00bb ","copyright":"Anne Marchis Mouren"},"cn":{"title":" La Verri\u00e8re - Visite guid\u00e9e \u00ab Spektrum \u00bb ","copyright":"Anne Marchis Mouren"},"fr":{"title":" La Verri\u00e8re - Visite guid\u00e9e \u00ab Spektrum \u00bb ","copyright":"Anne Marchis Mouren"},"sp":{"title":" La Verri\u00e8re - Visite guid\u00e9e \u00ab Spektrum \u00bb ","copyright":"Anne Marchis Mouren"},"nl":{"title":" La Verri\u00e8re - Visite guid\u00e9e \u00ab Spektrum \u00bb ","copyright":"Anne Marchis Mouren"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2024-09-12","doors":nul