T17:18:56+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":307969,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"other","ranking":0.20998684164914555,"languages":{"spoken":["en","nl","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[40,36],"translations":{"de":["Grafische K\u00fcnste","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Graphic art","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Arti grafiche","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Arts graphiques","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Artes gr\u00e1ficas","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Grafische kunst, vormgeving","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Bye Bye Binary typoth\u00e8que 2.0","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001432"},"pt":{"name":"Bye Bye Binary typoth\u00e8que 2.0","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001432"},"en":{"name":"Bye Bye Binary typoth\u00e8que 2.0","shortdescr":"Bye Bye Binary (BBB) is a French-Belgian collective created in 2018. It proposes the exploration of new typographic shapes adapted to the French language, especially the creation of new characters taking inclusive and post-binary language as an experimental graphic and research field.\nThis autumn come celebrate the Bye Bye Binary typotheque 2.0 launch!","longdescr":"Opening: Thursday 26-09-2024 18:00 -> 22:00\n\nCome celebrate the Bye Bye Binary typotheque 2.0 launch!\n\nBye Bye Binary (BBB) is a French-Belgian collective created in 2018. It proposes the exploration of new typographic shapes adapted to the French language, especially the creation of new characters taking inclusive and post-binary language as an experimental graphic and reasearch field.\n\nThis autumn the collective is putting online a new version of its typotheque where many post-binary fonts are distributed!\nThe collection gathers and distributes post-binary fonts designed by people inside and outside the collective, for everybody\u2019s use. The BBB collective gives this space as a welcoming place for their fellow queer type designers wanting to publish their fonts in a place which shares their values. Type design is not BBB\u2019s only goal, the collective aims to feed the debate around the political impact of graphic design, language and the representation of bodies and identities. The collective takes an activist position through community research, that is to say by and for people involved, through a feminist, queer, trans*, fag, bi and dyke perspective.\n\nThe launch and showcase will also be an opportunity to discuss the newly-released CUTE (Conditions d\u2019Utilisation Typographiques Engageantes)!\n\nWorkshop: Saturday 09-11-2024 14:00 -> 17:00\n\n-> -> During this workshop on November 9th, we will take a closer look at the type library and the CUTE license.\n\n* letters, ligatures, periodcentered, linking or symbiotic elements","performers":"Bye Bye Binary (artistic collective)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001432"},"it":{"name":"Bye Bye Binary typoth\u00e8que 2.0","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001432"},"cn":{"name":"Bye Bye Binary typoth\u00e8que 2.0","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001432"},"fr":{"name":"Bye Bye Binary typoth\u00e8que 2.0","shortdescr":"Bye Bye Binary (BBB) est une collective franco-belge form\u00e9e en 2018. Elle propose d\u2019explorer de nouvelles formes typographiques adapt\u00e9es \u00e0 la langue fran\u00e7aise, notamment par la cr\u00e9ation de caract\u00e8res prenant pour terrain d\u2019exp\u00e9rimentation et de recherche le langage et l\u2019\u00e9criture inclusive post-binaire. Cet automne, venez f\u00eater la sortie de la typoth\u00e8que Bye Bye Binary 2.0 !","longdescr":"Vernissage : Jeudi 26-09-2024 18:00 -> 22:00\n\nVenez f\u00eater la sortie de la typoth\u00e8que Bye Bye Binary 2.0 !\n\nBye Bye Binary (BBB) est une collective franco-belge form\u00e9e en 2018. Elle propose d\u2019explorer de nouvelles formes typographiques adapt\u00e9es \u00e0 la langue fran\u00e7aise, notamment par la cr\u00e9ation de caract\u00e8res* prenant pour terrain d\u2019exp\u00e9rimentation et de recherche le langage et l\u2019\u00e9criture inclusive post-binaire.\n\nCet automne, la collective met en ligne une nouvelle version de sa typoth\u00e8que o\u00f9 sont distribu\u00e9es moult fontes post-binaires !\nLa collection rassemble et diffuse des caract\u00e8res typographiques r\u00e9alis\u00e9s au sein de la collective et au-del\u00e0, pour les usages du plus grand nombre. La collective BBB propose cet espace comme un lieu d\u2019accueil et de diffusion pour ses adelphes dessinateur\u00b7ices de caract\u00e8res d\u00e9sireux\u00b7ses de publier leurs fontes en communaut\u00e9 de pens\u00e9e.\nBBB n\u2019a pas pour seul but le dessin de caract\u00e8res mais, plus largement, d\u2019alimenter le d\u00e9bat sur la charge politique du design graphique, du langage, des repr\u00e9sentations des corps et des identit\u00e9s. La collective adopte une position de recherche militante et communautaire, c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire par et avec des personnes concern\u00e9es, \u00e0 travers un prisme f\u00e9ministe, queer, trans*, p\u00e9d\u00e9\u00b7e, bi\u00b7e, gouin\u00b7e.\n\nLe lancement et la vitrine sera aussi l\u2019occasion de discuter des CUTE (Conditions d\u2019Utilisation Typographiques Engageantes) nouvellement sorties !\n\nWorkshop : Samedi 09-11-2024 14:00 -> 17:00\n\n-> -> Lors de l\u2019atelier du 9 novembre, nous nous pencherons plus en d\u00e9tail sur la typoth\u00e8que et sur la licence CUTE. Inscription via info@constantvzw.org\n\n* lettres, ligatures, points m\u00e9dians, \u00e9l\u00e9ments de liaison ou de symbiose","performers":"Bye Bye Binary (collective artistique)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001432"},"sp":{"name":"Bye Bye Binary typoth\u00e8que 2.0","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001432"},"nl":{"name":"Bye Bye Binary typoth\u00e8que 2.0","shortdescr":"Bye Bye Binary (BBB) is een Frans-Belgisch collectief dat in 2018 werd opgericht. Hun doel is om nieuwe typografische vormen te verkennen die aangepast zijn aan de Franse taal. Hun onderzoeksfocus ligt op het cre\u00ebren van lettertypes* waarbij met taal en postbinair inclusief schrift wordt ge\u00ebxperimenteerd.\nDit najaar kom en vier de lancering van de Bye Bye Binary 2.0 typotheek!","longdescr":"Vernissage: Donderdag 26-09-2024 18:00 -> 22:00\n\nKom en vier de lancering van de Bye Bye Binary 2.0 typotheek!\n\nBye Bye Binary (BBB) is een Frans-Belgisch collectief dat in 2018 werd opgericht. Hun doel is om nieuwe typografische vormen te verkennen die aangepast zijn aan de Franse taal. Hun onderzoeksfocus ligt op het cre\u00ebren van lettertypes* waarbij met taal en postbinair inclusief schrift wordt ge\u00ebxperimenteerd.\nDit najaar zet het collectief een nieuwe versie van hun typotheek met een groot aantal post-binaire lettertypes online!\nDe typotheek verzamelt en verspreidt lettertypes die binnen en buiten het collectief zijn gemaakt, om door zoveel mogelijk mensen te kunnen worden gebruikt. Het BBB-collectief biedt deze ruimte aan als een gastvrije plek voor mede-queer letterontwerpers die hun lettertypes willen publiceren op een plek die hun waarden deelt. Typeontwerp is niet het enige doel van BBB, het collectief wil het debat voeden over de politieke impact van grafisch ontwerp, taal en de representatie van lichamen en identiteiten. Het collectief neemt een activistische positie in en verbindt de gemeenschap met het onderzoek, dat wil zeggen door en voor betrokken mensen, vanuit een feministisch, queer, trans*, gay, biseksueel en lesbisch perspectief.\n\nDe lancering en showcase zullen ook een gelegenheid zijn om de pas uitgebrachte CUTE (Conditions d\u2019Utilisation Typographiques Engageantes) te bespreken!\n\nWorkshop: Zaterdag 09-11-2024 14:00 -> 17:00\n\n-> -> Tijdens deze workshop op 9 november bekijken we de typotheek en de CUTE licentie van dichterbij. Inschrijven via info@constantvzw.org\n\n* letters, ligaturen, middenpunten, verbindende of symbiotische elementen","performers":"Bye Bye Binary (kunstenaarscollectief)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001432"}},"place":{"id":243917,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Constant","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Constant est une association sans but lucratif bas\u00e9e \u00e0 Bruxelles, active depuis 1997 dans les domaines de l\u2019art et des m\u00e9dias.\r\nConstant est un atelier interdisciplinaire qui se concentre sur la culture et l\u2019\u00e9thique du web. La pratique artistique de Constant est inspir\u00e9e par la fa\u00e7on avec laquelle les infrastructures technologiques, les \u00e9changes de donn\u00e9es et les logiciels d\u00e9terminent nos vies quotidiennes. Quelques chantiers importants sont le logiciel libre, les alternatives au copyright et le (cyber)f\u00e9minisme.\r\nDe fa\u00e7on r\u00e9guli\u00e8re Constant organise des ateliers, des print-parties, des balades, des performances, des lectures et des rencontres \u2018Verbindingen\/Jonctions\u2019 pour un public qui aime l\u2019exp\u00e9rimentation, la discussion et des \u00e9changes de toutes sortes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Constant vzw","address_street_name":"Fortstraat","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Fortstraat, 5","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Constant is een vereniging zonder winstoogmerk werkzaam in het gebied tussen kunst en media.\r\nHet is een interdisciplinaire werkplaats die zich bezighoudt met de cultuur en ethiek van het web. De artistieke praktijk van Constant wordt ge\u00efnspireerd door de manier waarop technologische infrastructuren, data-uitwisseling en software ons dagelijkse leven bepalen. Belangrijke werkterreinen zijn vrije software, alternatieven op auteursrecht en (cyber)feminisme.\r\nConstant organiseert regelmatig workshops, print-parties, wandelingen en \u2018Verbindingen\/Jonctions\u2019-bijeenkomsten voor een publiek dat houdt van experimenten, discussies en uitwisselingen allerhande.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"]