lobby, you will find our in-house Neuhaus boutique, providing you with Belgium\u2019s best chocolates.\n\nLooking for an amazing Belgian Restaurant? \u201cTHE 1040\u201d is the place to be! In a bright and modern decor, Executive chef Gabriele Petrucci will surprise you with their reimagined Belgian classic dishes with a beautiful twist.\n\nDiscover our new Rooftop terrace bar https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/venue-details.The-Roof-by-the-1040-Rooftop.280373 on the 7th floor with an amazing view on the Jourdan square. It can be privatized up to 65 persons.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":"https:\/\/storage.net-fs.com\/hosting\/6128842\/9\/","visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Sofitel Brussels Europe","address_street_name":"Place Jourdan","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"H5282-SB@sofitel.com","website":"https:\/\/www.sofitel-brussels-europe.com\/en\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 235 51 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Place Jourdan, 1","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Sofitel Brussels Europe","address_street_name":"Place Jourdan","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"H5282-SB@sofitel.com","website":"https:\/\/www.sofitel-brussels-europe.com\/en\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 235 51 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Place Jourdan, 1","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Sofitel Brussels Europe","address_street_name":"Place Jourdan","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"H5282-SB@sofitel.com","website":"http:\/\/www.sofitel-brussels-europe.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 235 51 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Place Jourdan, 1","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":"D\u00e9couvrez la m\u00e9tamorphose de l'h\u00f4tel apr\u00e8s la r\u00e9novation du rooftop, des salles de r\u00e9union, du lobby, du bar et du restaurant.\n\nNotre h\u00f4tel 5* est id\u00e9alement situ\u00e9 sur la place Jourdan, au c\u0153ur du quartier europ\u00e9en, entour\u00e9 du parc L\u00e9opold.\n\nL'h\u00f4tel dispose de 147 chambres contemporaines et \u00e9l\u00e9gantes et de 12 salles de r\u00e9union \u00e0 la lumi\u00e8re du jour, r\u00e9cemment r\u00e9nov\u00e9es, pouvant accueillir jusqu'\u00e0 225 personnes.\n\nLes salles de r\u00e9union sont toutes situ\u00e9es au m\u00eame \u00e9tage autour de l'atrium lumineux.\n\nJuste \u00e0 l'int\u00e9rieur du hall de l'h\u00f4tel, vous trouverez la boutique Neuhaus, qui vous propose les meilleurs chocolats de Belgique.\n\nVous \u00eates \u00e0 la recherche d'un excellent restaurant belge ? Le \"THE 1040\" est l'endroit id\u00e9al ! Dans un d\u00e9cor lumineux et moderne, le chef ex\u00e9cutif Gabriele Petrucci vous surprendra avec ses plats classiques belges r\u00e9imagin\u00e9s avec une belle touche.\n\nD\u00e9couvrez notre nouveau bar terrasse-rooftop au 7\u00e8me \u00e9tage avec une vue imprenable sur la place Jourdan. Il peut \u00eatre privatis\u00e9 jusqu'\u00e0 65 personnes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Sofitel Brussels Europe","address_street_name":"Place Jourdan","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"H5282-SB@sofitel.com","website":"https:\/\/www.sofitel-brussels-europe.com\/en\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 235 51 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Place Jourdan, 1","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Sofitel Brussels Europe","address_street_name":"Jourdanplein","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"H5282-SB@sofitel.com","website":"https:\/\/www.sofitel-brussels-europe.com\/en\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 235 51 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Jourdanplein, 1","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":"Ontdek de metamorfose van het hotel na de renovatie van het rooftop, de vergaderzalen, de lobby, de bar en het restaurant.\n\nOns 5*-hotel is ideaal gelegen aan het levendige Jourdanplein in het hart van het EU-district, omringd door het Leopoldpark.\n\nHet hotel beschikt over 147 eigentijdse en stijlvolle kamers en 12 onlangs gerenoveerde vergaderzalen met daglicht en een capaciteit tot 225 personen.\n\nDe vergaderzalen liggen allemaal op dezelfde verdieping rond het lichte atrium.\n\nIn de lobby van het hotel vindt u onze eigen Neuhaus boetiek, waar u de beste Belgische chocolade kunt kopen.\n\nOp zoek naar een geweldig Belgisch restaurant? Bij \"THE 1040\" bent u aan het juiste adres! In een helder en modern decor zal Executive Chef Gabriele Petrucci je verrassen met hun heruitgevonden Belgische klassieke gerechten met een mooie twist.\n\nOntdek onze nieuwe bar op het Rooftop terras op de 7e verdieping met een prachtig uitzicht op het Jourdan plein. Het kan worden geprivatiseerd tot 65 personen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["European Quarter"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"nl":["Europese wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":22770,"location":{"lat":50.836847,"lon":4.3814799},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-10-28T14:24:26+01:00","published_at":"2015-10-20T15:18:41+02:00","import_origin":"efficy","external_id":22469,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":50001075,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Brussels By Foot","address_street_name":"\u00c0 la jonction entre la Galerie de la Reine et la Galerie du Roi (devant le restaurant \u00ab Le Marmiton \u00bb)","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselsbyfoot.com","website":"https:\/\/brusselsbyfoot.be\/sur-les-traces-de-karl-marx\/","phone_contact":"+32 472 39 82 17","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"\u00c0 la jonction entre la Galerie de la Reine et la Galerie du Roi (devant le restaurant \u00ab Le Marmiton \u00bb)","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Brussels By Foot is a small company offering unusual guided tours of Brussels. They create themed tours to help you discover Brussels from very special, sometimes surprising angles... All passionate Brusseleirs, they take you through the streets and alleys of Brussels and show you the city as they know it, as they love it.\n\nUrban legends, social struggles, crime scenes, Art Nouveau, or other themes, join us and discover Brussels as you've never seen it before!\n\nThe tours are available on registration via the website, but private tours for groups can also be arranged on request. In these private experiences, why not combine the tour with a chocolate tasting, a brusseleir aperitif, or a meal in an authentic Brussels establishment?","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Brussels By Foot","address_street_name":"\u00c0 la jonction entre la Galerie de la Reine et la Galerie du Roi (devant le restaurant \u00ab Le Marmiton \u00bb)","address_street_number":null,"address_stre