bi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.espacemagh.be\/projects\/choeurs-en-transe-festival-chaabi-habibi-1\/?pr=19165&gr=1&post=projects&sa=976","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001803"},"pt":{"name":"Choeurs en transe - Festival Chaabi Habibi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.espacemagh.be\/projects\/choeurs-en-transe-festival-chaabi-habibi-1\/?pr=19165&gr=1&post=projects&sa=976","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001803"},"en":{"name":"Choeurs en transe - Festival Chaabi Habibi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.espacemagh.be\/projects\/choeurs-en-transe-festival-chaabi-habibi-1\/?pr=19165&gr=1&post=projects&sa=976","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001803"},"it":{"name":"Choeurs en transe - Festival Chaabi Habibi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.espacemagh.be\/projects\/choeurs-en-transe-festival-chaabi-habibi-1\/?pr=19165&gr=1&post=projects&sa=976","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001803"},"cn":{"name":"Choeurs en transe - Festival Chaabi Habibi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.espacemagh.be\/projects\/choeurs-en-transe-festival-chaabi-habibi-1\/?pr=19165&gr=1&post=projects&sa=976","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001803"},"fr":{"name":"Choeurs en transe - Festival Chaabi Habibi #1","shortdescr":"Avec les choristes des ensembles Fatmas de Belgica, Bab\u2019Zouz et Le Ch\u0153ur Essaouira Mogador, accompagn\u00e9s du groupe Noujoum Souria et sous la direction de Safouane Moqadem et La\u00efla Amezian.","longdescr":"D\u00e9di\u00e9 au patrimoine musical chaabi du Maroc, le festival Chaabi Habibi port\u00e9 par la chanteuse La\u00efla Amezian et l\u2019asbl HalfmOon, explore cet univers musical ancestral \u00e0 travers sa pratique par les femmes de la diaspora de Belgique.\n\nPour lancer les festivit\u00e9s en beaut\u00e9 avec une soir\u00e9e d\u2019ouverture plac\u00e9e sous le signe de la joie et de la bonne humeur, nous sommes ravis d\u2019accueillir le projet musical Choeurs en Transe : un projet de rencontre entre des chorales de Bruxelles et d\u2019Essaouira.\n\nApr\u00e8s deux r\u00e9sidences artistiques faites de rencontres et d\u2019explorations musicales, les 40 choristes r\u00e9unis pr\u00e9senteront un r\u00e9pertoire vari\u00e9 de chansons anciennes tir\u00e9es des r\u00e9pertoires chaabi jud\u00e9o-marocains et r\u00e9-arrang\u00e9es pour l\u2019occasion. Une aventure artistique et humaine riche mettant \u00e0 l\u2019honneur un patrimoine musical arriv\u00e9 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 nous \u00e0 travers diff\u00e9rentes g\u00e9n\u00e9rations !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.espacemagh.be\/projects\/choeurs-en-transe-festival-chaabi-habibi-1\/?pr=19165&gr=1&post=projects&sa=976","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001803"},"sp":{"name":"Choeurs en transe - Festival Chaabi Habibi","shortde