"en":{"name":"Festival Projection Transition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/projectiontransition.fr","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003584"},"it":{"name":"Festival Projection Transition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/projectiontransition.fr","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003584"},"cn":{"name":"Festival Projection Transition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/projectiontransition.fr","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003584"},"fr":{"name":"Festival Projection Transition","shortdescr":"Projection Transition, c'est le festival de cin\u00e9-d\u00e9bat autour de la transition \u00e9cologique organis\u00e9 par The Shifters. A travers films et d\u00e9bats, le public est invit\u00e9 \u00e0 s'interroger sur des th\u00e9matiques cl\u00e9s de la transition. Cette ann\u00e9e, nous aspirons \u00e0 ouvrir un dialogue constructif sur la mani\u00e8re dont nous pouvons collectivement r\u00eaver, innover et \u00e9voluer.","longdescr":"Toutes les s\u00e9ances consistent en une projection du film, puis d'un d\u00e9bat entre un animateur et des pan\u00e9listes sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s sur une th\u00e9matique cl\u00e9 du film. La soir\u00e9e se concluera sur un cocktail organis\u00e9 dans la salle de r\u00e9ception du cin\u00e9ma.\n \nLa programmation compl\u00e8te est la suivante :\nlun. 25 nov. - La Ferme des Bertrand de Gilles Perret suivi du d\u00e9bat \u00ab Semer aujourd\u2019hui l\u2019agriculture de demain \u00bb ; \nmar. 26 nov. - Premier Contact de Denis Villeneuve suivi du d\u00e9bat \u00ab Conversation avec l'inconnu \u00bb ; \nmer. 27 nov. - La Belle Verte de Coline Serreau suivi du d\u00e9bat \u00ab Comment porter les nouveaux r\u00e9cits de la transition \u00e9cologiques ? \u00bb ; \njeu. 28 nov. - Nausica\u00e4 de la Vall\u00e9e du Vent de Hayao Miyazaki suivi du d\u00e9bat \u00ab En qu\u00eate d\u2019\u00e9quilibre, comment cohabiter avec la nature ? \u00bb. \n \nToutes les informations sur les films (Synopsis, R\u00e9alisation, etc.) sont \u00e0 retrouver sur le site internet du festival.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/projectiontransition.fr","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003584"},"sp":{"name":"Festival Projection Transition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/projectiontransition.fr","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003584"},"nl":{"name":"Festival Projection Transition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/projectiontransition.fr","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003584"}},"place":{"id":212482,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-vendome.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 65 53","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 18","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Kino Vend\u00f4me... mehr als 55 Jahre Kinoleidenschaft... Filmvorf\u00fchrungen, Liebhaber der Filmkunst, kulturelle Vielfalt, regelm\u00e4\u00dfige Festivals, eine Galerie f\u00fcr Filmkunst...","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-vendome.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 65 53","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 18","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-vendome.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 65 53","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 18","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"A temple of cinema in the heart of Matonge, the Vend\u00f4me cinema has been welcoming generations of film aficionados to its screening rooms for over 50 years. Many remember its legendary ushers.\r\n\r\nTrue to its beautiful slogan, \"Cultivate emotion\", this Brussels institution stands for auteur films and cultural diversity, above all. A pioneer of quality cinema, the Vend\u00f4me has made the success of many films that have entered into film legend (such as Satyricon or Last Tango in Paris). In the 1970s, its new screening rooms were inaugurated by Sophia Loren herself! A move and a handful of years later, the spirit of discovery and the family atmosphere of the Vend\u00f4me are still in full swing at 18 Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre.\r\n\r\nAt the cinema, comfort is king. At Le Vend\u00f4me, savour the pleasures of the Seventh Art from the depths of a Pullman chair.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-vendome.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 65 53","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 18","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-vendome.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 65 53","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 18","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-vendome.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 65 53","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 18","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Temple de la cin\u00e9philie en plein c\u0153ur de Matonge, le cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me accueille depuis plus de 50 ans des g\u00e9n\u00e9rations d\u2019amoureux du 7e art dans ses salles chaleureuses. Nombreux sont ceux qui se souviennent de ses mythiques ouvreuses.\r\n\r\nFid\u00e8le \u00e0 son beau slogan, \u00ab Cultivez l\u2019\u00e9motion \u00bb, cette institution ixelloise d\u00e9fend le cin\u00e9ma d\u2019auteur et la diversit\u00e9 culturelle avant tout. Pionnier d\u2019un cin\u00e9ma de qualit\u00e9, le Vend\u00f4me a fait le succ\u00e8s de nombreux films devenus mythiques (tels que Le Satyricon de ou Le Dernier Tango \u00e0 Paris). Dans les ann\u00e9es 70, ses nouvelles salles furent m\u00eame inaugur\u00e9 par Sophia Loren herself ! Un d\u00e9m\u00e9nagement et une poign\u00e9e d\u2019ann\u00e9es plus tard, l\u2019esprit de d\u00e9couverte et l\u2019ambiance familiale du Vend\u00f4me battent toujours leur plein au 18 Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre.\r\n\r\nAu cin\u00e9ma, le confort est roi. Au Vend\u00f4me, c\u2019est cal\u00e9s dans les courbes g\u00e9n\u00e9reuses d\u2019un si\u00e8ge Pullman que vous go\u00fbterez aux plaisirs du 7e art.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-vendome.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 65 53","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 18","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Cinema Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Waverse Steenweg","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-vendome.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 65 53","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Waverse Steenweg, 18","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"In het hartje van de Matongewijk ligt d\u00e9 tempel van de cinefiel: Cinema Vend\u00f4me. In de sfeervolle zalen genieten filmliefhebbers al meer dan vijftig jaar van de zevende kunst. Veel mensen herinneren zich nog de mythische ouvreuses.\r\n\r\nDit instituut in Elsene blijft trouw aan zijn slogan 'Cultivez l'\u00e9motion' en springt in de bres voor auteursfilms en culturele diversiteit. Als grondlegger van de kwaliteitsbioscoop heeft de Vend\u00f4me vele legendarische films (zoals Satyricon of Last Tango in Paris) tot een groot succes gemaakt. In de jaren 1970 werden de nieuwe zalen zelfs feestelijk geopend door Sophia Loren herself! Een verhuizing en enkele jaren later bruist de Vend\u00f4me aan de Waversesteenweg 18 nog steeds van de nieuwsgierigheid en familiale sfeer.\r\n\r\nIn de bioscoop is comfort koning. Zo geniet je in de Vend\u00f4me van de zevende kunst terwijl de royale rondingen van de Pullman-zetels je met open armen ontvangen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[4],"translations":{"de":["Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"pt":[null],"en":["Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"it":["Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"sp":["Matong\u00e9\/Saint-Boniface"],"nl":["Matonge\/Sint-Bonifatius"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":502,"location":{"lat":50.83746723,"lon":4.36293024},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-09-19T16:37:31+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:35+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":50002621,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Shifters Belgium","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Shifters Belgium","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":nul