 Emma Wauters, en collaboration avec Zinnema et Escale du Nord.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaledunord.brussels\/event\/artist-cafe-1070\/","email":"info@escaledunord.net","phone_contact":"+32 496 94 43 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003662"},"sp":{"name":"Artist Caf\u00e9 1070","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaledunord.brussels\/event\/artist-cafe-1070\/","email":"info@escaledunord.net","phone_contact":"+32 496 94 43 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003662"},"nl":{"name":"Artist Caf\u00e9 1070","shortdescr":"Ben je een kunstenaar die woont of werkt in Anderlecht? Wil je graag andere kunstenaars uit de gemeente ontmoeten? Wat je artistieke discipline of level ook is: je bent welkom op dit Artist Caf\u00e9: een gezellige en informele avond onder kunstenaars in caf\u00e9-setting.","longdescr":"We kunnen praten over onze kunst, onze projecten of iets anders\u2026 Het belangrijkste is dat we elkaar ontmoeten. Wie weet leidt het tot nieuwe idee\u00ebn of samenwerkingen?\n\nArtist Caf\u00e9 1070 is een project van de Nederlandstalige Cultuurdienst van Anderlecht en kunstenares Emma Wauters, in samenwerking met Escale du Nord en Zinnema.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaledunord.brussels\/event\/artist-cafe-1070\/","email":"info@escaledunord.net","phone_contact":"+32 496 94 43 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003662"}},"place":{"id":50002411,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Zinnema","address_street_name":"Rue de Veeweyde","address_street_number":"24-26","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Veeweyde, 24-26