ld, for example Ravichandra Kulur from India ( oa Anoushka\/Ravi Shankar, John McLaughlin, Aka Moon,..),\nBenny Bettane (Australia\/hand","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003867"},"it":{"name":"M\u00e3y\u00e3","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003867"},"cn":{"name":"M\u00e3y\u00e3","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003867"},"fr":{"name":"M\u00e3y\u00e3","shortdescr":"Nicolas Mortelmans est un joueur de sitar belge et \u00e9l\u00e8ve d'Anoushka Shankar.\nLe 12 avril, son album de sitar est sorti chez WERF Records.\nL'album est un m\u00e9lange de musique traditionnelle indienne et d'influences occidentales.\nDans chaque chanson, j'essaie d'aborder l'instrument d'une mani\u00e8re diff\u00e9rente. \n","longdescr":"Avec cet album, j'essaie de construire un pont entre mon amour pour la musique indienne et mes racines dans la musique occidentale.","performers":"Tarang Poddar (tabla\/India)\nJonas Meersmans (gitaar\/be)\nGreet Meert (tanpura\/be)\nNicolas Mortelmans (sitar\/be)\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003867"},"sp":{"name":"M\u00e3y\u00e3","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003867"},"nl":{"name":"M\u00e3y\u00e3","shortdescr":"Nicolas Mortelmans is een sitarspeler uit Belgi\u00eb en leerling van Anoushka Shankar.\nOp 12 april is zijn sitar album uitgebracht bij WERF Records.\nDe plaat is een mix van traditionele Indiase muziek met invloeden uit het westen.\nIn elk nummer probeer ik het instrument op een andere manier te benaderen. .\n","longdescr":"Met dit album probeer ik een brug te slaan tussen mijn liefde voor Indiase muziek en mijn wortels in de westerse muziekOp het album spelen gastmuzikanten van over de hele wereld, bijvoorbeeld Ravichandra Kulur uit India (oa Anoushka\/Ravi Shankar, John McLaughlin, Aka Moon,...),\nBenny Bettane (Australi\u00eb\/handpan) & Belgische vrienden zoals Roland van Campenhout, Tim Vanhamel en Stef Kamil Carlens.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003867"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","we