ieuport","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"zoartmusic@zoartmusic.com","website":"http:\/\/www.zoartmusic.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 32 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Nieuport, 1","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"ZoArt","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Nieuport","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"zoartmusic@zoartmusic.com","website":"http:\/\/www.zoartmusic.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 32 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Nieuport, 1","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"ZoArt","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Nieuport","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"zoartmusic@zoartmusic.com","website":"http:\/\/www.zoartmusic.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 32 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Nieuport, 1","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis plus de dix ans, ZoArt se concentre sur la cr\u00e9ation, la promotion et la diffusion de projets artistiques, avec un penchant pour le jazz et les musiques du monde. Depuis 2015, l\u2019asbl propose \u00e9galement une programmation artistique vari\u00e9e dans son caf\u00e9-th\u00e9\u00e2tre. Vous acc\u00e9dez \u00e0 un h\u00f4tel particulier du d\u00e9but du 20\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, \u00e0 proximit\u00e9 du canal de Bruxelles et du quartier Dansaert. Les musiciens, les interpr\u00e8tes et les artistes visuels sont invit\u00e9s \u00e0 engager un dialogue intime avec les habitants de Bruxelles issus des cultures les plus diverses. \r\n\r\n\u202f","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"ZoArt","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Nieuport","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"zoartmusic@zoartmusic.com","website":"http:\/\/www.zoartmusic.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 32 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Nieuport, 1","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"ZoArt","address_street_name":"Nieuwpoortlaan","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"zoartmusic@zoartmusic.com","website":"http:\/\/www.zoartmusic.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 32 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwpoortlaan, 1","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"ZoArt zet al ruim een decennium in op het cre\u00ebren, promoten en verspreiden van artistieke projecten, met een voorliefde voor jazz en wereldmuziek. Sinds 2015 voorziet de vzw in zijn theatercaf\u00e9 ook een gevarieerd artistiek programma. Je treedt binnen in een herenhuis uit het begin van de 20ste eeuw, vlak aan het Brusselse kanaal en de Dansaertwijk. Muzikanten, performers en beeldende kunstenaars worden er aangemoedigd om een intieme dialoog aan te gaan met Brusselaars uit de meest diverse culturen. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[3,8],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine","Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine","Canal"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine","Canal"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine","Canal"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine","Canal"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne","Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentru