ed to attract a style-conscious clientele of hotel guests as well the local in-crowd. The grandiose windows and soaring ceilings offer a surprisingly intimate setting.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"L\u2019h\u00f4tel The Dominican est une destination d\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gance au centre de Bruxelles. Situ\u00e9 derri\u00e8re le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de La Monnaie, en bas de la Grand-Place, notre h\u00f4tel design bruxellois offre d\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gantes chambres non-fumeurs, une cour int\u00e